{"id": "22", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman and another woman chat as a goat baaing is heard, while a black and white kid  is held on a white towel by a person.", "pred": "\\boxed{A black and white goat is being dried with towels by a person in a white coat while a woman speaks and a baby cries in the background.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A black and white goat is being dried with towels by a person in a white coat while a woman speaks and a baby cries in the background.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A black and white goat is being dried with towels by a person in a white coat while a woman speaks and a baby cries in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black and white goat kid is wrapped in towels on a table while a person in a white coat and a person in a green shirt handle it, and a woman says \\\"It hasn't walked yet. Come on. It hasn't even had the strength yet\\\" followed by laughter.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black-and-white goat kid lies on towels while a person in a white coat handles it with a green towel, accompanied by a woman speaking and a baby crying.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black and white goat lies on a towel being held by a person while a woman speaks and a goat bleats}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black and white goat lies on towels while a person in a white coat handles it, with voices saying \\\"Come on\\\" and \\\"Hasn't even had the strength yet\\\" as the goat bleats.}\"]", "time_sec": 25.402, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "23", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman delivers a speech at an event, standing at a podium with a microphone in front of a flag.", "pred": "A woman speaks at a podium with \"JACKSON DAY\" signage before a blue and red star backdrop while saying \"I'm a hillbilly I live very far away I live up in the hills of East Tennessee and the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV.\"", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A woman speaks at a podium with \"JACKSON DAY\" signage before a blue and red star backdrop while saying \"I'm a hillbilly I live very far away I live up in the hills of East Tennessee and the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV.\"", "cot": "[\"A woman speaks at a podium with \\\"JACKSON DAY\\\" signage before a blue and red star backdrop while saying \\\"I'm a hillbilly I live very far away I live up in the hills of East Tennessee and the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV.\\\"\", \"A woman in a black and white dress speaks at a Jackson Day podium with a blue and red star backdrop, gesturing with her right hand while saying \\\"I'm a hillbilly. I live very far away. I live up in the hills of East Tennessee and the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV.\\\"\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman in a black and white dress speaks into a microphone at a Jackson Day podium with a Tennessee flag backdrop while saying \\\"I live very far away\\\" and \\\"I live up in the hills of east Tennessee.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman speaks at a Jackson Day podium with a Tennessee flag backdrop while saying she is a hillbilly from East Tennessee hills.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman in a black and white dress speaks into a microphone at a Jackson Day podium with a blue and white star backdrop, stating \\\"I'm a hillbilly, I live very far away, I live up in the hills of East Tennessee, and the only thing I ever did was that I went and got myself on TV\\\" while raising her arm.}\"]", "time_sec": 30.974, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.89, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "24", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorbike engine purrs softly as it sits on display, showcasing its intricate details up close.", "pred": "\\boxed{A Honda mini bike with an orange fuel tank and black seat is shown while a person adjusts the engine and a loud, rhythmic engine sound plays.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A Honda mini bike with an orange fuel tank and black seat is shown while a person adjusts the engine and a loud, rhythmic engine sound plays.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A Honda mini bike with an orange fuel tank and black seat is shown while a person adjusts the engine and a loud, rhythmic engine sound plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person operates a stationary Honda minibike with an orange tank and black seat, producing a loud, steady engine idle.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange Honda mini motorcycle sits stationary as a person walks by and a hand adjusts the engine, while a small engine runs continuously.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A Honda mini bike with an orange tank and black seat is being started by a person in blue jeans, producing a loud, rhythmic engine sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person stands near an orange Honda minibike while a small engine idles.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.143, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
