{"id": "88", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On stage at an event, a man and a woman engage in conversation, a bell rings, and a cat meows, and a crowd applause.", "pred": "A panel debate with #TeamCats and #TeamDogs teams, a woman walking, a man standing up, and \"NO POINT!!\" text displayed, accompanied by applause and speech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A panel debate with #TeamCats and #TeamDogs teams, a woman walking, a man standing up, and \"NO POINT!!\" text displayed, accompanied by applause and speech.", "cot": "[\"A panel debate with #TeamCats and #TeamDogs teams, a woman walking, a man standing up, and \\\"NO POINT!!\\\" text displayed, accompanied by applause and speech.\", \"A panel debate on Team Cats versus Team Dogs occurs with a \\\"NO POINT!!\\\" graphic, audience applause, and a woman walking toward the center desk.\", \"A woman walks across a stage with #TeamCats and #TeamDogs signs while a man in a blue shirt approaches the center podium as the audience applauds.\", \"A woman in a gold top and black pants stands on a stage between two desks labeled \\\"#TeamCats\\\" and \\\"#TeamDogs\\\" while speaking to a man in a suit, with background images of animals on a screen and audience applause audible.\", \"A woman walks across a stage where people sit at desks labeled #TeamCats and #TeamDogs, a man speaks while a dog barks, and a graphic displays \\\"NO POINT !!\\\" with scores.\"]", "time_sec": 25.683, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "89", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lush green field next to a white fence, a man speaks as a woman screams, accompanied by the distant clip clops of horses.", "pred": "Two brown and white horses gallop in a grassy field while a man says \"There they go\" and a woman shouts \"Woo-hoo!\"; the sound of hooves is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "Two brown and white horses gallop in a grassy field while a man says \"There they go\" and a woman shouts \"Woo-hoo!\"; the sound of hooves is heard.", "cot": "[\"Two brown and white horses gallop in a grassy field while a man says \\\"There they go\\\" and a woman shouts \\\"Woo-hoo!\\\"; the sound of hooves is heard.\", \"\\\\boxed{Two brown and white horses run in a grassy field with fences and palm trees while a man says \\\"There they go\\\" and a woman screams \\\"Woo!\\\"}\", \"Two horses run in a field, and a person shouts \\\"Woo-hoo\\\" as they pass a fence.\", \"Two brown and white horses gallop in a fenced field while a man says \\\"There they go\\\" and a woman screams \\\"Woo-hoo!\\\" as they run past jumps.\", \"Two brown and white horses gallop around a fenced grassy arena with jumps while a man says \\\"There they go\\\" and a woman shouts \\\"Woo-hoo!\\\"\"]", "time_sec": 23.593, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 31.25, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "90", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and yellow train, accompanied by a truck, travels down the tracks as the train horn blows and the signal beeps in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives move slowly on tracks while a loud multi-tone air horn blasts against a clear blue sky.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives move slowly on tracks while a loud multi-tone air horn blasts against a clear blue sky.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives move slowly on tracks while a loud multi-tone air horn blasts against a clear blue sky.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives pass a white container under a clear sky while a loud train horn blares.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives numbered 8265 and 4918 pass a white container under a clear blue sky while a train horn blasts repeatedly.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red BNSF locomotives pass a white container while a train horn blares.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red and yellow BNSF locomotives numbered 8265 and 4918 move slowly past a white container while a loud multi-chime train horn blasts repeatedly.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.608, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "91", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the darkness of the night, a man's voice squeals and rustles as a lion hides in tall grass and bushes.", "pred": "\\boxed{A brown dog and black-and-white cat move in dense brush while a man speaks Russian and birds chirp.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A brown dog and black-and-white cat move in dense brush while a man speaks Russian and birds chirp.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A brown dog and black-and-white cat move in dense brush while a man speaks Russian and birds chirp.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Lioness in thorns, dog growling, human speaking}\", \"\\\\boxed{Lioness in thorny bush with black-and-white kitten; man speaks Russian phrases \\\"Good kill\\\" and \\\"Brilliant\\\" amid bird chirps and rustling.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two brown animals in thorny bushes with a black and white animal visible; speech saying \\\"Go kill\\\" and \\\"Go kill\\\" and \\\"Ja, bring it\\\" and \\\"Bring it\\\" and bird chirps}\", \"\\\\boxed{Lioness in brush with cubs, male voice speaks 'Good girl' while bird chirps.}\"]", "time_sec": 23.802, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "92", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the audio, two men are chatting and laughing, while in the visual, a person is holding a controller and playing a free video game available on operating system software.", "pred": "\\boxed{Person shuffles Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a World Championship Qualifier mat while male voices discuss card names and laugh.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Person shuffles Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a World Championship Qualifier mat while male voices discuss card names and laugh.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Person shuffles Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a World Championship Qualifier mat while male voices discuss card names and laugh.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands shuffle Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a 2015 World Championship Qualifier playmat while male voices discuss deck contents.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands shuffle Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a Regional 2015 playmat while a male voice lists card names and a female voice laughs.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands shuffle Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a 2015 World Championship Qualifier playmat while male voices discuss card formats.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands shuffle Yu-Gi-Oh! cards on a 2015 World Championship Qualifier playmat while a male voice lists card names including Maxx, Gores, Denko, and Fusion, accompanied by shuffling sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.72, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "93", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of children screaming mixes with a man's laughter, followed by a whisper and a young boy's voice, as a child  hugs a young girl at the bottom of the stairs of a house, with a woman standing nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{Girls scream and laugh as boy chases them in living room, man says \"I got it\" amid laughter.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Girls scream and laugh as boy chases them in living room, man says \"I got it\" amid laughter.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Girls scream and laugh as boy chases them in living room, man says \\\"I got it\\\" amid laughter.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A girl in a striped top runs from a boy in a grey sweatshirt while a child in a dark hoodie chases her in a living room with a leopard print couch, accompanied by a child's scream, laughter, and a woman's voice saying \\\"I got it.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Girl and boy wrestle while others watch, with children shouting and a man speaking in a living room.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Girl playing with children in living room with leopard print couch, white staircase, and red cups while laughing, shouting, and yelling \\\"I got it!\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Girl plays with boy and man in living room with leopard print couch, staircase, and red cups while children laugh, shout, and grunt}\"]", "time_sec": 23.792, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "94", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rustling followed by a brief speech accompanies the visual of a white toilet bowl with water inside in a bathroom setting.", "pred": "\\boxed{A white toilet with the lid up is flushed, producing water sounds and a male voice saying \"Now I'll make it flush.\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A white toilet with the lid up is flushed, producing water sounds and a male voice saying \"Now I'll make it flush.\"}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A white toilet with the lid up is flushed, producing water sounds and a male voice saying \\\"Now I'll make it flush.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{A toilet is flushed with water swirling while a man says \\\"Now I'll make it flush.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white toilet with the lid up is flushed, producing a loud rushing water sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white toilet bowl is shown as water flushes with a loud gurgle and splash sound.}\", \"A toilet is flushed, with water swirling and gurgling sounds heard as the lid is lifted.\"]", "time_sec": 18.221, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "95", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen with a small white dog on the floor, amidst a blue sky of hope and love, white noise is followed by muffled speech and rustling.", "pred": "\\boxed{Blue title card shows text about a 7-month-old dog learning to close doors in Fall 2007 while a woman speaks and a white dog barks in a kitchen}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Blue title card shows text about a 7-month-old dog learning to close doors in Fall 2007 while a woman speaks and a white dog barks in a kitchen}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Blue title card shows text about a 7-month-old dog learning to close doors in Fall 2007 while a woman speaks and a white dog barks in a kitchen}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white puppy stands on hind legs to close a cabinet door in a kitchen while a woman says \\\"Close\\\" and a door slams.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Blue screen displays text about a 7-month-old learning to close doors while a white dog jumps at a cabinet and door in a kitchen with a woman speaking and footsteps audible.}\", \"A white puppy in a kitchen attempts to close a cabinet door while a person speaks and claps.\", \"\\\\boxed{Blue title card reads \\\"gg, 7 months old, learns to close doors - Fall, 2007\\\" while a woman speaks and a dog barks in a kitchen}\"]", "time_sec": 22.179, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "96", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of footsteps approaching a sliding door, followed by a man speaking, then the door creaking shut, in a small kitchen with white cabinets and a refrigerator.and towels also.", "pred": "\\boxed{Inside a kitchen with white appliances and yellow walls, a washer and dryer are shown with a door opening and closing, accompanied by a male voice saying \"washer dryer\" and fabric rustling sounds.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Inside a kitchen with white appliances and yellow walls, a washer and dryer are shown with a door opening and closing, accompanied by a male voice saying \"washer dryer\" and fabric rustling sounds.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Inside a kitchen with white appliances and yellow walls, a washer and dryer are shown with a door opening and closing, accompanied by a male voice saying \\\"washer dryer\\\" and fabric rustling sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Inside a home, a person speaks \\\"washer dryer\\\" while entering a laundry room with a white washer and dryer.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A laundry room with washer and dryer contains a male voice saying \\\"washer dryer\\\" while a door closes.}\", \"\\\\boxed{White refrigerator, washer, and dryer are seen while a male voice says \\\"washer dryer\\\" and a door closes.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white refrigerator stands in a kitchen with a washer and dryer visible in an adjacent room, accompanied by a male voice saying \\\"washer dryer\\\" and the sound of a door opening and closing.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.155, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "97", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a green field, a small dog chases a duck while a film projector runs, capturing the playful symphony of quacks, whimpers, and chirps.", "pred": "\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog chases and bites a duck on grass while clucking and squawking sounds occur.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog chases and bites a duck on grass while clucking and squawking sounds occur.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog chases and bites a duck on grass while clucking and squawking sounds occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Dog plays with duck, quacks and barks in grassy yard.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog in a grassy yard aggressively pins and drags a mallard duck across the lawn while honking quacks and clucking sounds occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog sniffs and bites a duckling in a grassy yard while a goose honks and quacks in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A German Shepherd dog sniffs and bites a duck on green grass while a chicken clucks and ducks quack.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.643, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "98", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of a vehicle engine revving and running idle as cloth rustles, with a modern car dashboard displaying the speedometer and tachometer.", "pred": "\\boxed{An Audi S4 dashboard displays illuminated warning lights and gauges while an engine idles audibly in a stationary vehicle.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{An Audi S4 dashboard displays illuminated warning lights and gauges while an engine idles audibly in a stationary vehicle.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{An Audi S4 dashboard displays illuminated warning lights and gauges while an engine idles audibly in a stationary vehicle.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Audi dashboard shows illuminated warning lights and gauges while engine idles with a low hum and intermittent beeping.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An Audi S4 dashboard with warning lights displays 10822 km and 140898 km odometer readings while an engine idles with a high-pitched whine and intermittent clicking sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A stationary Audi dashboard displays illuminated warning lights and gauges while a car engine idles and a gear shift is engaged.}\", \"A stationary Audi S4 dashboard displays warning lights and odometer readings while the engine idles, with a manual gear shift visible and system loading on the center console screen.\"]", "time_sec": 22.643, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "99", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of clicking and clacking fills the room as a person types on an old typewriter, their hands focused on the black keys, with a bell ringing and a clack as the carriage returns, set on a table with a sheet of paper.", "pred": "\\boxed{A hand types on a black manual typewriter, producing distinct mechanical clicks as German text appears on white paper.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A hand types on a black manual typewriter, producing distinct mechanical clicks as German text appears on white paper.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A hand types on a black manual typewriter, producing distinct mechanical clicks as German text appears on white paper.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand types on a black typewriter producing rapid mechanical clacking sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand types on a vintage typewriter with metallic keys and red ribbon, producing sharp mechanical clacks and metallic whirring sounds as letters appear on paper.}\", \"A hand types on a black typewriter with silver keys, producing rhythmic mechanical clacks and metallic typebar impacts as white paper advances with German text.\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand types on a vintage typewriter, producing rhythmic metallic clacks as German text appears on paper.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.297, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "100", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a train engine running with bells chime, a lawn mower, and a steam engine running with a steam whistle blowing, as a crowd of people stand near a small train on the tracks.", "pred": "A miniature train with passengers travels along tracks while a steam engine emits smoke and a child's voice is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A miniature train with passengers travels along tracks while a steam engine emits smoke and a child's voice is heard.", "cot": "[\"A miniature train with passengers travels along tracks while a steam engine emits smoke and a child's voice is heard.\", \"\\\\boxed{People ride miniature steam trains on grass tracks under a green shelter while engine chuffs and whistle blows}\", \"\\\\boxed{People ride miniature trains under a green shelter while engine hissing and children shouting occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A miniature steam train with green and yellow cars carrying passengers on grassy tracks under a green metal shelter while people in blue uniforms stand nearby, accompanied by the sounds of a steam engine, crowd chatter, and a child's excited exclamation.}\", \"A miniature train passes through a station with people aboard and onlookers while engine sounds and children's voices are heard.\"]", "time_sec": 22.697, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "101", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video game world bursts with a gunfiring, a large screen background.", "pred": "\\boxed{A pixelated soldier shoots red armored enemies in a tiled room while an alert states \"Enemies are in the desert!\" accompanied by gunfire and explosion sounds.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A pixelated soldier shoots red armored enemies in a tiled room while an alert states \"Enemies are in the desert!\" accompanied by gunfire and explosion sounds.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A pixelated soldier shoots red armored enemies in a tiled room while an alert states \\\"Enemies are in the desert!\\\" accompanied by gunfire and explosion sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pixelated soldier shoots red enemies in a tiled room while gunfire and explosions sound as the text 'Alert! Enemies are in the desert!' appears.}\", \"A pixelated character shoots blue energy at red enemies inside a glass room, producing gunfire and explosions while a warning announces enemies in the desert.\", \"\\\\boxed{A pixelated soldier fires a weapon at red enemies in a tiled room, producing gunfire sounds and explosions, with on-screen text reading \\\"Alert! Enemys are in the desert!\\\"}\", \"A pixelated soldier shoots a shotgun at red enemy figures in a tiled room while an alert states enemies are in the desert and gunfire sounds occur.\"]", "time_sec": 22.491, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
