{"id": "119", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice is heard over the idle bus engine, while the camera pans from the open door of the bus to the metal steps of an escalator going up and down.", "pred": "\\boxed{Visuals show a bus ramp with yellow handrails and metal steps, audio features a man speaking about wheelchair capacity and a 2001 bus model.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Visuals show a bus ramp with yellow handrails and metal steps, audio features a man speaking about wheelchair capacity and a 2001 bus model.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a bus ramp with yellow handrails and metal steps, audio features a man speaking about wheelchair capacity and a 2001 bus model.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white bus with deployed ramp and open door shows metallic steps and yellow handrails while a man's voice describes its wheelchair capacity and 2001 model features.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Bus ramp with yellow rail and \\\"no smoking\\\" sign; audible speech describes capacity and entry features.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white bus with deployed wheelchair ramp and open door reveals metal stairs with ribbed surfaces and a \\\"WATCH YOUR STEP\\\" sign, while a male voice discusses capacity and age as a door chime sounds}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white bus shows its deployed ramp with yellow handrails and a \\\"no smoking\\\" sign while a male voice describes its wheelchair capacity and entry features amid engine hum and tire noise}\"]", "time_sec": 24.98, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "120", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman  is speaking in front of a green screen, with people communicating in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{The woman's face with blue facial tracking dots against a green screen displays yellow text \"two\", \"fiv\", \"six\", \"eig\", \"nin\" while audio counts \"zero one two three four five six seven eight nine\".}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{The woman's face with blue facial tracking dots against a green screen displays yellow text \"two\", \"fiv\", \"six\", \"eig\", \"nin\" while audio counts \"zero one two three four five six seven eight nine\".}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{The woman's face with blue facial tracking dots against a green screen displays yellow text \\\"two\\\", \\\"fiv\\\", \\\"six\\\", \\\"eig\\\", \\\"nin\\\" while audio counts \\\"zero one two three four five six seven eight nine\\\".}\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman with blue facial tracking points on a green screen speaks numbers zero through nine while yellow and red text overlays display corresponding words.\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman with blue face tracking points against a green background counts numbers from zero to nine while the word 'two' and 'fiv' appear.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Woman with blue facial tracking points on green screen vocalizes numbers zero through nine while yellow text displays 'two', 'fiv', 'six', 'eig', 'nin' in sequence.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Person with blue facial tracking points on green screen speaks numbers zero through nine while yellow text displays corresponding words.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.851, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.