{"id": "121", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption captures the essence of a lively event with music, male speech, and distant sizzling, featuring a collage of pictures of men wearing hats and sunglasses, celebrating in a crowd.", "pred": "\\boxed{Visuals show a man in a black hat and sunglasses speaking against a night background with a yellow pole and people, while audio features a man introducing \"Sound the System\" with a crowd cheering and a megaphone sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Visuals show a man in a black hat and sunglasses speaking against a night background with a yellow pole and people, while audio features a man introducing \"Sound the System\" with a crowd cheering and a megaphone sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a man in a black hat and sunglasses speaking against a night background with a yellow pole and people, while audio features a man introducing \\\"Sound the System\\\" with a crowd cheering and a megaphone sound.}\", \"A man wearing a hat and sunglasses speaks into a megaphone while a crowd cheers, accompanied by upbeat music and a voiceover announcing \\\"Sound the system Alborosie\\\" and a release date.\", \"A man with long blonde hair, a black hat, and sunglasses speaks energetically while a crowd cheers and a megaphone sounds in the background, followed by a list of song titles over a dark backdrop.\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals: Album cover with crowd and man with megaphone, then man in hat and sunglasses speaking; Audio: Upbeat music followed by voice saying \\\"Hey, this is Big Kenny, Sound the System, Alborosie\\\" and \\\"You gotta check it out, all right? Come on, peace\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{The video shows a man with sunglasses and a hat speaking outdoors at night next to a poster, while audio features a man introducing \\\"Big Kenny Sound the System Alborosie\\\" with music and crowd sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 30.087, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
