{"id": "170", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man speaks over an intercom as a muffled helicopter engine roars, followed by gunshots firing in a video game displayed on a laptop screen.", "pred": "\\boxed{Inside a military vehicle cockpit, a digital map displays combat, while a voice announces enemy location west, an explosion occurs, and a notification states objective Alpha has been neutralized.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Inside a military vehicle cockpit, a digital map displays combat, while a voice announces enemy location west, an explosion occurs, and a notification states objective Alpha has been neutralized.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Inside a military vehicle cockpit, a digital map displays combat, while a voice announces enemy location west, an explosion occurs, and a notification states objective Alpha has been neutralized.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Inside a vehicle cockpit, a digital map displays a tactical engagement with explosions and gunfire sounds while a voice announces \\\"west of your location\\\" and \\\"Objective Alpha has just been neutralized.\\\"}\", \"A tank commander views a tactical map inside a vehicle while hearing radio communications and explosions. \\\\boxed{Tank commander views tactical map with explosions and radio chatter inside vehicle.}\", \"A military vehicle interior displays a tactical map with explosions while a voice announces \\\"objective alpha has just been neutralized\\\" over gunfire and an explosion.\", \"\\\\boxed{In a vehicle cockpit, a tactical map displays blue and orange markers while a voice announces \\\"AA west of your location\\\" followed by an explosion and \\\"Objective Alpha has just been neutralized\\\".}\"]", "time_sec": 26.164, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enab