{"id": "220", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The loud bustle and screech of traffic mix with the cheers of spectators as they watch cars and motorcycles racing on the track.", "pred": "\\boxed{Truck performing a burnout on a racetrack with spectators watching and bleachers in the background while a motorcycle is visible and loud engine roar and tire screeching sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Truck performing a burnout on a racetrack with spectators watching and bleachers in the background while a motorcycle is visible and loud engine roar and tire screeching sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Truck performing a burnout on a racetrack with spectators watching and bleachers in the background while a motorcycle is visible and loud engine roar and tire screeching sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A dark gray pickup truck performs a burnout on a drag strip while emitting white smoke and roaring engine sounds as spectators watch from colorful bleachers.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black truck performs a burnout on a drag strip while spectators watch and a motorcycle is parked nearby, accompanied by a loud engine revving sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A gray truck performs a burnout on a drag strip while spectators watch from the stands, producing loud engine roars and tire squeals.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A blue truck performs a burnout on a drag strip while spectators watch, with loud engine revving and tire squealing audible.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.547, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "221", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city square, conversations buzz as a train bell dings and a whistle blows, with cheers erupting in the background, all under the watchful gaze of a large clock mounted on the side of an old building.", "pred": "\\boxed{A stone clock tower facade with moving statues and a blue astronomical clock face, accompanied by distant crowd chatter and a woman's voice in Czech.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A stone clock tower facade with moving statues and a blue astronomical clock face, accompanied by distant crowd chatter and a woman's voice in Czech.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A stone clock tower facade with moving statues and a blue astronomical clock face, accompanied by distant crowd chatter and a woman's voice in Czech.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Crowd chatter and a woman speaking in Czech accompany a close-up of the Prague Astronomical Clock with moving statues and rotating hands.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A stone clock tower facade with moving astronomical dial hands and emerging figures in upper windows, accompanied by distant crowd chatter, a woman speaking Czech, and a loud siren wail.}\", \"\\\\boxed{\\\\text{A stone clock tower with moving figures above a blue astronomical clock, accompanied by indistinct crowd chatter and a woman speaking Czech.}}\", \"\\\\boxed{A stone building features a blue astronomical clock with gold hands and figures, while distant crowd chatter and a child's voice saying \\\"Alea\\\" play over ambient noise.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.862, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-