{"id": "234", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " In a game, a large fire emerging from a dark background, while a man speaks with a heartbeat in the background.", "pred": "A text logo with fire animation appears over a dark background while a man speaks in French, followed by a black screen and then a Minecraft snowy landscape with trees and water visible in first-person view.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A text logo with fire animation appears over a dark background while a man speaks in French, followed by a black screen and then a Minecraft snowy landscape with trees and water visible in first-person view.", "cot": "[\"A text logo with fire animation appears over a dark background while a man speaks in French, followed by a black screen and then a Minecraft snowy landscape with trees and water visible in first-person view.\", \"A burning flame animation and French text \\\"A bientôt\\\" appear on a dark textured background while dramatic orchestral music plays and a male voice speaks in French over silence, followed by a snowy Minecraft landscape view with a player's hand visible and no audible sounds.\", \"A fire animation plays under French text while a man speaks in French over dramatic music, followed by a Minecraft snowy forest view with no sound.\", \"\\\\boxed{Fiery logo with French text \\\"A bientôt\\\" and website URL appears over black background, followed by Minecraft snowy biome footage with French male voice stating \\\"Y a tout le monde, c'est le mardi 20 janvier 2014, donc euh...\\\"}\", \"Text on black background with fire, then snowy Minecraft forest view with French speech about cold weather.\"]", "time_sec": 26.573, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.3, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
