{"id": "243", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling kitchen, a man speaks while the clinking of dishes fills the air, followed by the hiss of an oil mister spraying, as he takes a freshly baked loaf of bread out of the oven and places it on the counter.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two baguettes sit on a rack as a person sprays oil from a can while a man speaks.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two baguettes sit on a rack as a person sprays oil from a can while a man speaks.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two baguettes sit on a rack as a person sprays oil from a can while a man speaks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person removes two golden-brown loaves from a toaster oven onto a wire rack, sprays them with oil while saying \\\"give it a quick mist of oil\\\" and \\\"protect our crust\\\" amid sizzling sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person sprays oil on two baguettes on a rack next to an open toaster oven while a man speaks}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two baguettes on a rack sit on a granite countertop beside an open toaster oven while a person sprays them with oil, accompanied by a woman's voice and metallic clanking sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person places two golden-brown baguettes on a wire rack on a granite countertop next to an open toaster oven while spraying them with oil, accompanied by the sound of spraying and speech about protecting the crust at 300 degrees.}\"]", "time_sec": 25.389, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
