{"id": "276", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Emergency vehicle sirens blare as two adult males converse on a dark city street at night, with cars and fire trucks driving down the road past a gas station with red lights.", "pred": "A car is stopped at a red light while a goat bleats and a siren wails.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A car is stopped at a red light while a goat bleats and a siren wails.", "cot": "[\"A car is stopped at a red light while a goat bleats and a siren wails.\", \"A police car with flashing red lights is stopped at a red light at night with a gas station on the right and a person standing by a white car, while a loud siren wails and an indistinct voice speaks.\", \"A red car stops at a red light at night while a goat bleats and a man speaks in Japanese.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A red car stops at a red light at night while a goat bleats and a man speaks in Japanese.}\", \"\\\\boxed{At night, a car waits at a red light with a gas station visible, while a goat bleats and a siren wails.}\", \"A car stops at a red light at night with a gas station on the right while a goat bleats loudly in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 22.746, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
