{"id": "278", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An adult male is speaking while crinkling plastic, with soft music playing in the background, as a person holds a small package of headphones in their hands next to a camera and a blue case.", "pred": "\\boxed{Person unboxes headset and cable from blue \"Enjoy\" box while speaking; plastic rustling and clicking accompany audio.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Person unboxes headset and cable from blue \"Enjoy\" box while speaking; plastic rustling and clicking accompany audio.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Person unboxes headset and cable from blue \\\"Enjoy\\\" box while speaking; plastic rustling and clicking accompany audio.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Person unboxes a headset with a mini USB adapter from a box with \\\"Enjoy.\\\" printed on the lid, while a male voice describes the contents.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Person opens blue box with \\\"Enjoy.\\\" label, removes black cable and accessories while voice states \\\"We have headset, yep, like I said, it's headset with the mini USB adapter. It's nice.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands unpack accessories from a white box with a blue \\\"Enjoy\\\" lid, while audio states \\\"We have headset, yep, like I said, it's headset with the mini USB adapter.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands unpack a headset, mini USB adapter, and accessories from a box labeled \\\"Enjoy\\\" while a man states \\\"We have headset, yep, like I said it's headset with the mini USB adapter, it's nice, we have the...\\\"}\"]", "time_sec": 26.453, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "279", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle horn beeps as it approaches the light at the end of the dark tunnel.", "pred": "\\boxed{A dark garage scene shows a blue box and a car with a headlight on while a cow moos twice.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A dark garage scene shows a blue box and a car with a headlight on while a cow moos twice.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A dark garage scene shows a blue box and a car with a headlight on while a cow moos twice.}\", \"\\\\boxed{In a dark garage, a vehicle's headlight illuminates a metal wall beside a blue box while a cow moos twice with a brief silence between moos.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a dark garage with a lit car headlight and blue box near a metal door; audio features a loud, sustained car horn honk.}\", \"\\\\boxed{In a dark garage, a vehicle's headlight illuminates a concrete wall and metal roll-up door next to a blue box while a cow moos twice.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A dark garage scene shows a car's illuminated headlight and blue equipment against a metal door while a cow moos twice in the background.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.714, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "280", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a telephone dialing tone and a plastic switch flipping on and off, set against a blue background with a logo featuring the earth, a man and a woman in blue bathrobes, and a serene blue sky.", "pred": "\\boxed{Hand holds silver flip phone near circuit board powering glowing bulb, clapping sound heard, logo transitions to blue screen with credits}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Hand holds silver flip phone near circuit board powering glowing bulb, clapping sound heard, logo transitions to blue screen with credits}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Hand holds silver flip phone near circuit board powering glowing bulb, clapping sound heard, logo transitions to blue screen with credits}\", \"A hand holds a silver flip phone next to a blue phone on a breadboard circuit as a light bulb illuminates, accompanied by a mechanical click and hum.\", \"\\\\boxed{Hand holds silver flip phone over circuit board with green PCB and white bulb; loud click and hum accompany screen display.\", \"\\\\boxed{Hand holds silver flip phone on table with electronics, green light flashes, bulb turns on, then JSC Innovations logo appears with names and website on blue background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand holds a silver flip phone near a circuit board while a blue phone rests nearby, and a bright light turns on as mechanical clicks and electronic beeps play.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.576, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "281", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a motor revving up accompanies a close-up of a motorcycle engine being inspected.", "pred": "A Mercedes key is held near the front wheel well while the engine runs and the cooling fan spins, with the hood open revealing engine components.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A Mercedes key is held near the front wheel well while the engine runs and the cooling fan spins, with the hood open revealing engine components.", "cot": "[\"A Mercedes key is held near the front wheel well while the engine runs and the cooling fan spins, with the hood open revealing engine components.\", \"\\\\boxed{A Mercedes-Benz engine bay with a non-operational fan and running engine, a hand holding a key, and a man speaking about the vehicle's status.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Car engine bay shows fan spinning while speaker states engine hasn't run and key is in hand}\", \"\\\\boxed{A silver Mercedes car with its hood open shows an engine bay with a running fan while a hand holds a key and a man states the engine hasn't run for days}\", \"\\\\boxed{Open car hood reveals engine components while Mercedes key is displayed and engine runs}\"]", "time_sec": 20.287, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "282", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit cave, a man with a knife in hand laughs with a group of men as metal clacks and bangs echo, while debris floats in the water nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two people manipulate a flashlight and chopsticks near a textured surface while a man speaks and laughs.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two people manipulate a flashlight and chopsticks near a textured surface while a man speaks and laughs.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two people manipulate a flashlight and chopsticks near a textured surface while a man speaks and laughs.}\", \"\\\\boxed{People use flashlights and sticks to examine dry leaves and debris in a cave while laughing and speaking.}\", \"\\\\boxed{People examine debris in dim light, speaking and laughing while using sticks, with a sharp clack and laughter audible.}\", \"\\\\boxed{People use sticks to dig through dry leaves and debris at night while speaking, laughing, and making sharp noises.}\", \"\\\\boxed{People use tools to sift through dry leaves and debris at night while speaking and laughing.}\"]", "time_sec": 19.603, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "283", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a motorbike revving echoes as a man in a blue helmet rides a motorcycle on a race track, thrilling a crowd of spectators.", "pred": "\\boxed{A motorcycle racer in blue and yellow gear sits on a black bike as a man in black walks beside him on a track with bleachers, while a loud engine idles.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A motorcycle racer in blue and yellow gear sits on a black bike as a man in black walks beside him on a track with bleachers, while a loud engine idles.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A motorcycle racer in blue and yellow gear sits on a black bike as a man in black walks beside him on a track with bleachers, while a loud engine idles.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A motorcyclist in blue and yellow gear on a black bike with a star logo revs an engine at a drag strip as a man in black signals while spectators watch from bleachers.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A motorcyclist in blue and yellow gear revs a black motorcycle engine loudly on a drag strip with spectators watching from bleachers as a track official signals with hand gestures.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A motorcyclist in blue and yellow leathers sits on a black motorcycle at a drag strip with spectators in bleachers and a man in black near a barrier while a loud engine idles and revs.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A rider in blue and yellow gear sits on a black motorcycle while a man in black stands nearby, with crowd noise and engine revving audible.}\"]", "time_sec": 25.11, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "284", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sound and sight, a man speaks amidst hissing, cooing pigeons, and flapping bird wings, as several planes and flocks of birds soar through the sky.", "pred": "\\boxed{Visuals: multiple black birds flying against gray sky; Audio: male speech about wind and birds, plus distant bird chirps}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Visuals: multiple black birds flying against gray sky; Audio: male speech about wind and birds, plus distant bird chirps}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Visuals: multiple black birds flying against gray sky; Audio: male speech about wind and birds, plus distant bird chirps}\", \"\\\\boxed{Flock of birds flying in sky with man speaking Greek and birds chirping}\", \"\\\\boxed{Flock of birds flying in sky with wind blowing and man speaking in Greek}\", \"\\\\boxed{A flock of birds flies against a gray sky while a man speaks in Greek and birds chirp.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Flapping wings and distant speech are heard against a gray sky background as birds fly in a formation.}\"]", "time_sec": 18.976, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
