{"id": "288", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the dark of night, two small green frogs croak on a branch as plastic flutters in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two yellow-green frogs on a wet log, one inflating its vocal sac, against a dark background with green foliage and a black cable, accompanied by a loud, continuous electronic buzzing sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two yellow-green frogs on a wet log, one inflating its vocal sac, against a dark background with green foliage and a black cable, accompanied by a loud, continuous electronic buzzing sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two yellow-green frogs on a wet log, one inflating its vocal sac, against a dark background with green foliage and a black cable, accompanied by a loud, continuous electronic buzzing sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two green and yellow frogs sit on a wet log at night, one inflating its vocal sac while an engine idles.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two green frogs sit on a log at night, one inflating its vocal sac while a deep, rhythmic croaking sound plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two green and yellow frogs on a wet log at night, one inflating its vocal sac while croaking. }\", \"\\\\boxed{Two green and yellow frogs on a log at night; one inflates vocal sac while engine hums.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.467, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "289", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of chirping birds, a man secures a piece of wood to the roof of a home using a chain they are two mens.", "pred": "Two men adjust ropes on a wooden bunk bed frame outside a shed while a boat rests nearby and a vehicle engine idles.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "Two men adjust ropes on a wooden bunk bed frame outside a shed while a boat rests nearby and a vehicle engine idles.", "cot": "[\"Two men adjust ropes on a wooden bunk bed frame outside a shed while a boat rests nearby and a vehicle engine idles.\", \"Two men manipulate ropes on a wooden structure while discussing shelf removal in front of an open garage with a boat visible.\", \"\\\\boxed{Two men adjust ropes on a wooden bunk bed outside a shed while one says \\\"Yeah, we might be able to get it off the bottom shelf\\\" amid wind noise and a distant engine hum.}\", \"Two men work on a wooden structure with ropes while a man speaks in the background.\", \"\\\\boxed{Two men work on a wooden bunk bed frame outdoors near a shed, handling ropes while a man speaks and a bird chirps.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.208, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
