{"id": "378", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Cartoon characters dancing on a white background, black English letters. The picture of the diner people eating, the little girl eating and watching. There was a man talking and a wonderful music in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{A cartoon character named Richie Le dances against a white background while a goat bleats and a man says \"What's up\" over electronic music, followed by scenes of yellow flowers with red tags and Vietnamese New Year decorations in a crowded hall with a macaron menu board and a child eating waffles.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A cartoon character named Richie Le dances against a white background while a goat bleats and a man says \"What's up\" over electronic music, followed by scenes of yellow flowers with red tags and Vietnamese New Year decorations in a crowded hall with a macaron menu board and a child eating waffles.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A cartoon character named Richie Le dances against a white background while a goat bleats and a man says \\\"What's up\\\" over electronic music, followed by scenes of yellow flowers with red tags and Vietnamese New Year decorations in a crowded hall with a macaron menu board and a child eating waffles.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A cartoon character dances while the text \\\"RICHIE LE\\\" appears, followed by yellow flowers with red cards, a \\\"Chúc Mừng Năm Mới\\\" banner and red lantern, and a crowded indoor event with a macaron menu, all accompanied by goat bleating, a \\\"What's up?\\\" spoken phrase, and rhythmic music.}\", \"A cartoon character dances to electronic music with a voice saying \\\"what's up\\\" in a crowded indoor space decorated with red and yellow elements.\", \"\\\\boxed{A cartoon character dances against a white background with \\\"Richie Le\\\" text, followed by a festive indoor gathering with yellow flowers, red decorations, and a menu board, accompanied by \\\"What's up?\\\" speech, electronic music, and crowd noise.}\", \"A cartoon character dances to electronic music while a crowd eats and chants in a festive room with red decorations and a menu board.\"]", "time_sec": 27.957, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
