{"id": "389", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man in the suit walked straight ahead with the flower pushing the door, the man in the hat went out, the woman in her pajamas was ready to open the door, and the music was playing in the background.", "pred": "A man in a suit looks at a man in a coat holding flowers outside a door while a woman in a towel walks down a hallway with a sad violin melody playing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A man in a suit looks at a man in a coat holding flowers outside a door while a woman in a towel walks down a hallway with a sad violin melody playing.", "cot": "[\"A man in a suit looks at a man in a coat holding flowers outside a door while a woman in a towel walks down a hallway with a sad violin melody playing.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a suit opens an intercom door to a man in a hat holding flowers while a woman in a towel walks down a hallway as dramatic music plays}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a dark suit stands in a dim hallway while an older man in a winter coat enters the apartment building and they converse as a woman in a white towel walks down a blue-lit corridor; a violin plays a dramatic, high-pitched melody.}}\", \"A man in a suit looks out a window then opens a door to a man in a beanie holding flowers as dramatic orchestral music plays.\", \"A woman in a towel walks down a hallway while a man in a suit stands at a door and an intercom buzzes and a bell rings.\"]", "time_sec": 23.666, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "390", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The red characters flickered against a green background, the fire alarm sounded, and the background was filled with the sound of music, the voice of people and the alarm of fire.", "pred": "\\boxed{Red text on black background displays \"DUMP THE HOUSE\" then \"[34] Apt Fire: 1824 Metzert\" while a siren wails and a voice shouts \"first to fire!\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Red text on black background displays \"DUMP THE HOUSE\" then \"[34] Apt Fire: 1824 Metzert\" while a siren wails and a voice shouts \"first to fire!\"}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Red text on black background displays \\\"DUMP THE HOUSE\\\" then \\\"[34] Apt Fire: 1824 Metzert\\\" while a siren wails and a voice shouts \\\"first to fire!\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{\\\\text{Black screen with red text \\\"DUMP THE HOUSE\\\" and \\\"[34] Apt Fire: 1824 Metzertz\\\" while a fire engine siren wails and a man shouts \\\"First in fire!\\\"}}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red text \\\"DUMP THE HOUSE\\\" and \\\"[34] Apt Fire 1824 Metz\\\" on black background with fire truck siren and \\\"First to fire\\\" speech.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red text \\\"DUMP THE HOUSE\\\" and \\\"[34] Apt Fire 1824 Metz\\\" on black screen with fire engine siren and \\\"First to fire!\\\" voiceover.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red text displays \\\"DUMP THE HOUSE\\\" then \\\"[34] Apt Fire 1824 Metzert\\\" on black background with sirens and \\\"First to fire\\\" voiceover.}\"]", "time_sec": 26.868, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "391", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two white subtitles were cast on the black screen, and images of flames appeared, red forbidden signs and black three-line fonts, with a bluish fast-paced music background.", "pred": "\\boxed{Visuals show a green flame experiment with text explaining methods, while audio features energetic electronic dance music.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Visuals show a green flame experiment with text explaining methods, while audio features energetic electronic dance music.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a green flame experiment with text explaining methods, while audio features energetic electronic dance music.}\", \"A black background displays white text explaining two methods to make green fire with a green flame visual, followed by a danger sign warning about corrosive liquids and protective equipment, accompanied by electronic dance music with a male voice sample.\", \"A green flame rises from a container while electronic music plays and a danger sign warns of corrosive liquids.\", \"A green flame burns in a bowl while electronic music plays and a danger sign warns about corrosive liquids.\", \"A green flame burns in a bowl on a black background while electronic music plays and a danger sign warns of corrosive liquids.\"]", "time_sec": 20.005, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "392", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A group of stars sang on stage, the light was so cool, the audience below was shouting and dancing to the music. The background was a burst of electronic dance.", "pred": "\\boxed{DJ with arms raised faces crowd while electronic music with crowd cheering and a woman speaking plays in a concert setting}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{DJ with arms raised faces crowd while electronic music with crowd cheering and a woman speaking plays in a concert setting}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{DJ with arms raised faces crowd while electronic music with crowd cheering and a woman speaking plays in a concert setting}\", \"\\\\boxed{A bald man in a leather jacket raises his arms before a massive crowd at a concert with green lasers, fire, and electronic music.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A DJ performs at a concert with green lasers, a large crowd cheers, and electronic music plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A DJ and performer energize a massive concert crowd with electronic dance music, fire effects, and dynamic green and red laser lights under dim ambient conditions.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Concert visuals of DJ and crowd with green lasers and fire effects accompany EDM music and crowd cheers.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.043, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "393", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rain poured down from the roof, and five yellow monks, wearing hats, stood side by side in the rain, their eyes fixed, the sound of the rain thunder rumbling in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{Rain falls on a blue surface and rooftop as thunder cracks and five figures stand in a misty street while water drips from hats onto yellow clothing.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Rain falls on a blue surface and rooftop as thunder cracks and five figures stand in a misty street while water drips from hats onto yellow clothing.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Rain falls on a blue surface and rooftop as thunder cracks and five figures stand in a misty street while water drips from hats onto yellow clothing.}\", \"A group of robed figures in conical hats stand in a rainy street at night holding spears and drums while a train rumbles in the background.\", \"Rain falls on a roof, a group of robed figures in hats stand in a line holding spears and shields, with a heavy vehicle engine rumbling in the background.\", \"Five hooded figures in conical hats stand in rain holding spears and round shields while distant engine rumble echoes.\", \"A group of people in raincoats and hats stand in a wet street as rain falls and thunder rumbles.\"]", "time_sec": 20.111, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "394", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The machine is stirring the flour, the woman holds a small bowl and uses a spoon to stir the eggs, the background is the machine turns and the woman speaks.", "pred": "\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid mixer blends white powder while a woman adds two eggs, accompanied by rhythmic mechanical whirring.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid mixer blends white powder while a woman adds two eggs, accompanied by rhythmic mechanical whirring.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid mixer blends white powder while a woman adds two eggs, accompanied by rhythmic mechanical whirring.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid Professional HD stand mixer kneads white powder in a metal bowl while a voice says \\\"we're gonna put our uh eggs two eggs\\\" and a whisking sound occurs.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid mixer blends white powder while a person adds eggs and liquid, producing mechanical whirring and sizzling sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid Professional HD mixer with a paddle attachment blends white powder while a person pours yellow liquid from a glass bowl into the bowl, accompanied by the sound of a woman speaking and the mixer's mechanical whirring.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange KitchenAid stand mixer blends white powder while a person pours yellow liquid from a glass bowl into the bowl amid continuous mechanical whirring and spoken instructions to add two eggs.}\"]", "time_sec": 23.948, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
