{"id": "398", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A picture of the woods shows green text that changes with the sound of the music.", "pred": "\\boxed{A serene forest with a large tree beside a reflective pond displays green cursive lyrics \"With you in my life I'll never think twice\" and \"It's you I've been waiting to call\" while a female vocalist sings \"never think twice\" and \"it's you I've been waiting to call\" in a slow, emotional ballad.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A serene forest with a large tree beside a reflective pond displays green cursive lyrics \"With you in my life I'll never think twice\" and \"It's you I've been waiting to call\" while a female vocalist sings \"never think twice\" and \"it's you I've been waiting to call\" in a slow, emotional ballad.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A serene forest with a large tree beside a reflective pond displays green cursive lyrics \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice\\\" and \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call\\\" while a female vocalist sings \\\"never think twice\\\" and \\\"it's you I've been waiting to call\\\" in a slow, emotional ballad.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A serene forest with a large tree and reflective water features green text lyrics \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice\\\" and \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call\\\" overlaid while a female vocalist sings the lyrics.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A serene forest scene with a large tree and calm water features green cursive lyrics overlaid as a female vocalist sings \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice\\\" followed by \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call\\\" over gentle piano and string accompaniment.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visual: Static forest scene with large tree and lake; Audio: Female singing lyrics \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice\\\" then \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{A serene forest landscape with a large tree and calm water reflects green foliage while a female vocalist sings \\\"With you in my life I'll never think twice\\\" and \\\"It's you I've been waiting to call\\\" accompanied by a piano melody.}\"]", "time_sec": 30.313, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.17, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
