{"id": "409", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music goes a woman enters the door and then walks up the stairs, the picture turns and the woman looks out the door in an enclosed room.", "pred": "\\boxed{Blonde woman in blue dress with ice skate bag ascends wooden staircase in dim blue-lit house while rock music with male vocals plays}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Blonde woman in blue dress with ice skate bag ascends wooden staircase in dim blue-lit house while rock music with male vocals plays}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Blonde woman in blue dress with ice skate bag ascends wooden staircase in dim blue-lit house while rock music with male vocals plays}\", \"\\\\boxed{Blonde woman in blue dress holds ice skate near door, then ascends staircase while rock music with female vocals plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A blonde woman in a blue dress carrying a white ice skate stands before a mirror in a dim hallway, then ascends stairs while a female vocalist sings \\\"fire\\\" and \\\"let me have the grace\\\" in a pop song.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Blonde woman in blue dress carries white ice skate up stairs in dim house while rock song plays and woman stands before vending machine in blue-lit corridor}\", \"\\\\boxed{A blonde woman in a blue dress holding a white ice skate stands near a door while a pop song plays, then she walks up stairs in a dim house and stands before a vending machine in a blue-lit room.}\"]", "time_sec": 23.766, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "410", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the winter, a yellow bus was driving along the road, and people next to it were excited to see and greet it, and road was fully covered with snow.", "pred": "\\boxed{Yellow school bus from Safe-Way Bus Co. drives on snowy road while engine roars and male voices discuss bus arrival}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Yellow school bus from Safe-Way Bus Co. drives on snowy road while engine roars and male voices discuss bus arrival}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Yellow school bus from Safe-Way Bus Co. drives on snowy road while engine roars and male voices discuss bus arrival}\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow Safe-Way Bus Co. school bus drives down a snowy road with its headlights on while a man says \\\"Look there's a bus coming\\\" and another man says \\\"He was\\\" accompanied by laughter and vehicle engine noise.}\", \"A yellow school bus drives on a snowy road while a man says \\\"Look there's a bus coming\\\" and a woman laughs and says \\\"There he is\\\" as it passes.\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow Safe-Way Bus Co. school bus drives down a snowy street as a man says \\\"Look at there's a bus coming\\\" and another man replies \\\"Daddy was on a bus\\\" while a car horn honks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow school bus labeled SAFE-WAY BUS CO. drives on a snowy road while a man speaks and a dog barks.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.664, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
