{"id": "412", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a computer screen, a game character walks in the dark and stops under a candle. As the man explains it, a row of English subtitles appears in bule colour.", "pred": "\\boxed{A pixelated character stands on a red brick floor in a dark, ruined building with a lit candle, a red pentagram, and scattered papers, while a male voice narrates \"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult\" and \"Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3.\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A pixelated character stands on a red brick floor in a dark, ruined building with a lit candle, a red pentagram, and scattered papers, while a male voice narrates \"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult\" and \"Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3.\"}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A pixelated character stands on a red brick floor in a dark, ruined building with a lit candle, a red pentagram, and scattered papers, while a male voice narrates \\\"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult\\\" and \\\"Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pixelated character stands in a dark, ruined school building with a red pentagram and lit candle as a narrator introduces \\\"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult: Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3\\\".}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pixelated character stands on a brick floor near a candle and red pentagram in a dilapidated room while a man speaks about occult stories in a cursed school building.\", \"\\\\boxed{A pixelated character stands in a dark, ruined school building with a red pentagram and candle while a narrator states \\\"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult: Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3\\\".}\", \"\\\\boxed{Pixelated character in blue dress stands on red brick floor of ruined school building with candle and red pentagram; audio features male voice speaking \\\"Strange But True: Stories of the Occult\\\" followed by \\\"Chasing Down the Hidden Past of the Cursed School Building - part 3\\\"}\"]", "time_sec": 31.318, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.24, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
