{"id": "419", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black machine was placed on a white table, and a man was holding the desiccant and explaining how to use it.", "pred": "\\boxed{A person holds a black camera with a visible SD card while a digital photo printer sits idle on a white table with a green power light.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A person holds a black camera with a visible SD card while a digital photo printer sits idle on a white table with a green power light.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A person holds a black camera with a visible SD card while a digital photo printer sits idle on a white table with a green power light.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand inserts a camera memory card into a DNP digital photo printer while a man says \\\"On the camera, here's the other card and it's got a C on it, see it up in the left hand corner if you...\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Person holds camera near DNP digital photo printer as it beeps while speaking about the card with a C.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person inserts a memory card into a DNP digital photo printer while a voice describes the card's \\\"C\\\" marking.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Person operates DNP digital photo printer with camera while handling card, hearing speech and mechanical clicks}\"]", "time_sec": 21.812, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "420", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "At a lake, a man in a white coat and a red hat caught a fish in a fishing net on the shore and said a word, and the sound of the water.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man in an orange cap and white shirt on a boat uses a net to land a fish while a boat engine hums and he says \"Give me hooks.\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man in an orange cap and white shirt on a boat uses a net to land a fish while a boat engine hums and he says \"Give me hooks.\"}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A man in an orange cap and white shirt on a boat uses a net to land a fish while a boat engine hums and he says \\\"Give me hooks.\\\"}\", \"A man in an orange cap fishes on a lake with a rod, reels in a catch while splashing water, and speaks \\\"Give me hooks\\\" amid boat sounds.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a white shirt and red cap fishes from a boat on a lake with trees, pulling a bent rod and netting a fish while saying \\\"Give me hooks\\\" over splashing water and reel sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a red cap on a boat reels in a fish with a bent rod, splashing water while a male voice says \\\"Give me hooks\\\" and splashing sounds occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a red cap fishes on a boat, reeling in a line while a boat engine hums and he speaks, \\\"Give me hooks\\\" as he maneuvers near a cypress tree in a lake.}\"]", "time_sec": 25.171, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "421", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A machine was left in the clearing, said the man next to it. The machine was running without stopping.", "pred": "A red engine idles loudly while a man says \"Let's see, we got one backfire out of it\" and \"Wow, wow\" as a hand sprays near it.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A red engine idles loudly while a man says \"Let's see, we got one backfire out of it\" and \"Wow, wow\" as a hand sprays near it.", "cot": "[\"A red engine idles loudly while a man says \\\"Let's see, we got one backfire out of it\\\" and \\\"Wow, wow\\\" as a hand sprays near it.\", \"\\\\boxed{Red engine idles loudly as man sprays starter fluid, causing backfire, with wrench and rag nearby.}\", \"A red lawnmower engine is shown as a man sprays it and it backfires while running.\", \"\\\\boxed{A red Craftsman 16.5 HP engine runs and backfires while a man speaks and sprays it, with tools and rags on a concrete floor.}\", \"A red engine runs with a loud, sputtering sound while a man says \\\"Let's see, we got one backfire out of it\\\" and \\\"Wow, wow\\\" as he sprays it.\"]", "time_sec": 22.13, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "422", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One women, while speaking, held a red zipper with two hands that linked two wicked white cloths with different colors of love, making a zipper sound and turning it around.", "pred": "\\boxed{Hands pin red fabric on white paper while sewing sounds and Turkish speech occur.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Hands pin red fabric on white paper while sewing sounds and Turkish speech occur.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Hands pin red fabric on white paper while sewing sounds and Turkish speech occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands pin a red strip to white fabric with sewing sounds and Turkish speech.\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands sew a red strip onto white fabric with pins while a woman speaks in Turkish}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands pin red fabric to white material with pins while a woman speaks Turkish and plastic snaps.\", \"\\\\boxed{Hands pin red fabric to white paper with green and yellow pins while Turkish speech discusses pinning and sewing a white line. }\"]", "time_sec": 17.684, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "423", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a forest, a man sat in the cab of a tool car talking while manipulating the machine to cut down trees and make a buzzing sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{An operator controls a forestry excavator with hydraulic arms in a wooded area while engine noise and a man's voice discuss stump height.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{An operator controls a forestry excavator with hydraulic arms in a wooded area while engine noise and a man's voice discuss stump height.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{An operator controls a forestry excavator with hydraulic arms in a wooded area while engine noise and a man's voice discuss stump height.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand operates a joystick inside a green machine cabin with a forest visible through the window, accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine and a man speaking.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Operator controls a hydraulic excavator arm in a forest while speaking about stump height and engine noise.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Operator operates a logging machine in a forest, manipulating controls with his hand while speaking about stumps and hearing engine noise.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person operates a hydraulic excavator arm in a forest while a man's voice speaks over engine noise.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.204, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "424", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With a bell ringing, a purple flashing disk on the screen moves from far to near, followed by a woman's prayer.", "pred": "\\boxed{Purple kaleidoscopic circle with white text and faint singing}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Purple kaleidoscopic circle with white text and faint singing}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Purple kaleidoscopic circle with white text and faint singing}\", \"\\\\boxed{A purple mandala with Polish text and a woman singing \\\"O mój niebo\\\" over ambient wind noise.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Purple mandala with Polish text and a woman's \\\"Oh\\\" vocalization over sustained drone and hiss.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Purple mandala with Polish text \\\"Niech szczęście i lagodność trwały, niechaj wszystkie istoty osiągną pomocy\\\" accompanied by a high-pitched sustained vocal drone.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Purple mandala visuals with Polish text overlay and a female voice chanting \\\"Om Mani Padme Hum\\\" over continuous drone music.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.735, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "425", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman lay on the bed, talking with a gasp, beside the sound of the baby.", "pred": "\\boxed{A close-up of a person with glasses and tape on their face while a dog barks, a bird chirps, and a woman speaks.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A close-up of a person with glasses and tape on their face while a dog barks, a bird chirps, and a woman speaks.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A close-up of a person with glasses and tape on their face while a dog barks, a bird chirps, and a woman speaks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Close-up of a person's face with glasses and bandages, mouth slightly open, inhaling with a deep, raspy breath as a bird chirps and a woman speaks about taking an inhaler.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Close-up of a person's face with glasses and a bandage on their eyelid, wearing braces, lying down while inhaling deeply and speaking about taking an inhaler, accompanied by a cat meow and high-pitched bird chirps.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A close-up of a person's face with glasses and tape on their eyes while inhaling and speaking, accompanied by a dog barking and a cat meowing.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Close-up of a person with glasses and a bandage on their eye lying down while inhaling with a dog barking in the background and a woman speaking}\"]", "time_sec": 25.19, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "426", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car alarm was ringing, and then a person was pressing the car alarm, making different noises from different buttons.", "pred": "\\boxed{A finger presses the PIERCE button on a RSC 4000 control panel, activating a loud, continuous electronic siren sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A finger presses the PIERCE button on a RSC 4000 control panel, activating a loud, continuous electronic siren sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A finger presses the PIERCE button on a RSC 4000 control panel, activating a loud, continuous electronic siren sound.}\", \"A hand presses the Pierce button on a RSC 4000 control panel while an emergency siren wails continuously.\", \"\\\\boxed{A finger presses the PIERCE button on a black RSC 4000 control panel with green and red illuminated buttons, while a loud electronic siren and a brief beep sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand presses the pierce button on a RSC 4000 control panel with green illuminated buttons while an ambulance siren wails in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A finger presses the \\\"Pierce\\\" button on a RSC 4000 control panel, causing a loud siren and beep.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.104, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "427", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music came to mind, with a red bulge on a black background appeared and a piece of brown pipe hung on the wall.", "pred": "\\boxed{An American Flyer control button is shown, followed by wind chimes, with metallic chime sounds audible.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{An American Flyer control button is shown, followed by wind chimes, with metallic chime sounds audible.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{An American Flyer control button is shown, followed by wind chimes, with metallic chime sounds audible.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black American Flyer control button by The A.C. Gilbert Co. of New Haven, Conn., U.S.A. with a red button is shown, followed by a wall-mounted wind chime with brass tubes and wooden top, producing clear, resonant musical tones.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black American Flyer Control Button by The A.C. Gilbert Co. in New Haven, Conn., U.S.A. is shown alongside a wall-mounted set of brass chimes producing a musical tone.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An American Flyer control button by The A.C. Gilbert Co. is shown followed by a glockenspiel being played.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black American Flyer control button from The A.C. Gilbert Co. displays a red button, followed by a wooden-framed set of brass chimes producing a melodic, bell-like chime sound.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.45, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "428", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the background of a prairie morning, with soothing musical recollections, a yellow plane and different English letters gradually appeared.", "pred": "A yellow airplane flies over green hills while the alphabet song plays and letters A through G appear in clouds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A yellow airplane flies over green hills while the alphabet song plays and letters A through G appear in clouds.", "cot": "[\"A yellow airplane flies over green hills while the alphabet song plays and letters A through G appear in clouds.\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow plane flies over green hills while the ABCs appear in clouds and a female voice sings the alphabet.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow cartoon airplane flies over green hills as a child sings the alphabet with a soft piano accompaniment.}\", \"A yellow toy airplane flies left over green hills as a child sings the alphabet while letters A through G appear in colorful clouds.\", \"\\\\boxed{A yellow toy airplane flies over green hills while a female voice sings the alphabet.}\"]", "time_sec": 18.245, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "429", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A group of soldiers slowly ascended the high platform with flags, and the audience saluted to the sound of the majestic song.", "pred": "\\boxed{Sailors carry a casket draped in a flag up steps to a platform while a choir sings \"Y la tierra en su centro da tierra al sol\" amid solemn music and applause.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Sailors carry a casket draped in a flag up steps to a platform while a choir sings \"Y la tierra en su centro da tierra al sol\" amid solemn music and applause.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Sailors carry a casket draped in a flag up steps to a platform while a choir sings \\\"Y la tierra en su centro da tierra al sol\\\" amid solemn music and applause.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Sailors in white uniforms carry a casket draped with a flag up steps to a platform while a male vocalist sings in Spanish amid solemn music and crowd applause.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Sailors carry a flag-draped coffin up steps as a man sings in Spanish during a solemn ceremony.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Sailors in white uniforms carry a flag-draped coffin up stairs while a choir sings solemnly in Spanish}\", \"\\\\boxed{Sailors carry a casket draped in a flag while singing solemnly in Spanish.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.927, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "430", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a patch of grass, a small flower swayed in the wind with music.", "pred": "\\boxed{A pale rose with water droplets is shown in close-up, followed by a soft-focus field of pink and white roses, while a female voice sings \"I shall be hanged\" over gentle, sustained music.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A pale rose with water droplets is shown in close-up, followed by a soft-focus field of pink and white roses, while a female voice sings \"I shall be hanged\" over gentle, sustained music.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A pale rose with water droplets is shown in close-up, followed by a soft-focus field of pink and white roses, while a female voice sings \\\"I shall be hanged\\\" over gentle, sustained music.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pale pink rose with water droplets is shown in focus while a female voice sings \\\"I shall be hanged\\\" over soft music, followed by a blurred view of pink and white roses with text \\\"MUSIC BY SRI CHINMOY\\\" overlaid.}\", \"A pale rose with water droplets on petals is shown against a green leafy background while a female voice sings a wordless melody then \\\"I shall be hungry\\\" in a sad tone.\", \"A close-up of a pale rose with water droplets transitions to a field of pink and white roses with text overlay while a female vocalist sings \\\"I shall be hung\\\" with piano accompaniment.\", \"A close-up of a white rose with water droplets followed by pink roses with a female voice singing \\\"I shall be hungry\\\" over soft music.\"]", "time_sec": 25.343, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "431", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cartoon character swings his fist and chases a yellow pencil in the light music, then sits happily on the floor playing with his phone.", "pred": "\\boxed{An angry stick figure on lined paper confronts a yellow pencil, then smiles and walks away while a goat bleats and electronic beeps play.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{An angry stick figure on lined paper confronts a yellow pencil, then smiles and walks away while a goat bleats and electronic beeps play.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{An angry stick figure on lined paper confronts a yellow pencil, then smiles and walks away while a goat bleats and electronic beeps play.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A stick figure runs from a pencil, then laughs and talks on a phone while a goat bleats and a car horn sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A stick figure chases a pencil, trips, and laughs while a goat bleats and a phone rings.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Stick figure runs, dodges yellow pencil, yells, then laughs while using phone against power lines, with goat bleat, music, and sounds of movement and laughter.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An angry stick figure runs from a yellow pencil on lined paper while a man sings \\\"La la la\\\" and a goat bleats.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.061, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
