{"id": "433", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A old man sat beside the corner, playing the strings with his hands to a melodious sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man plays a dulcimer while a stringed instrument sounds}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man plays a dulcimer while a stringed instrument sounds}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A man plays a dulcimer while a stringed instrument sounds}\", \"\\\\boxed{An older man plays a Deleby zither with a pick against a brick wall backdrop, producing a sustained, resonant, plucked melodic string sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a metallic dulcimer while a sustained, high-pitched, melodic plucked string sound is audible.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a grey shirt plays a dulcimer producing a sustained high-pitched electronic tone against a brick wall and window blinds.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a dulcimer with a pick while seated in a room with brick walls and blinds, producing a stringed musical sound.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.15, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "434", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man speaks with a mouse clicking on a computer file.", "pred": "\\boxed{Visual: Windows desktop with open file explorer and code editor; Audio: Male voice speaking in a foreign language.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Visual: Windows desktop with open file explorer and code editor; Audio: Male voice speaking in a foreign language.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Visual: Windows desktop with open file explorer and code editor; Audio: Male voice speaking in a foreign language.}\", \"\\\\boxed{\\\\text{Desktop with file explorer and Visual Studio windows showing traffic patch files alongside Hindi speech saying 'So my car will go and I will edit it for a while' with mouse clicks and file operation sounds.}}\", \"\\\\boxed{Desktop shows file explorer and code editor while a man speaks in Hindi}\", \"\\\\boxed{A Windows desktop shows file management software with an open dialog box displaying audio files, a warning message about calling a missing module, and a male voice speaking in a foreign language.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Computer screen shows file explorer with dialog boxes and file list while a man speaks in Hindi.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.543, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "435", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, the picture is constantly shaking with the music of the disco.", "pred": "\\boxed{Anime girl with orange hair sits on a roof holding a purple parasol as white doves fly and pink petals fall while a gentle piano melody plays.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Anime girl with orange hair sits on a roof holding a purple parasol as white doves fly and pink petals fall while a gentle piano melody plays.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Anime girl with orange hair sits on a roof holding a purple parasol as white doves fly and pink petals fall while a gentle piano melody plays.}\", \"An anime girl with orange hair sits on a roof holding a purple umbrella as pink doves fly and cherry blossoms fall while soft piano music plays and a digital glitch sound interrupts.\", \"\\\\boxed{Anime girl on roof with umbrella and pigeons under pink sky with soft piano music and electronic beat}\", \"\\\\boxed{An anime girl with orange hair, red robe, and purple umbrella sits on a tiled roof with pink doves and petals, accompanied by calm piano music followed by a sharp electronic buzz.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An anime girl with red hair and red dress sits on a tiled roof under a purple parasol with pink doves and falling petals while gentle piano music plays}\"]", "time_sec": 24.141, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
