{"id": "438", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Several people were coughing , and a group of people came out of the room and coughed with their hands over their mouths, followed by a woman's voice.", "pred": "A grid of people coughing is shown with a voiceover explaining that coughing into your sleeve avoids sickness.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A grid of people coughing is shown with a voiceover explaining that coughing into your sleeve avoids sickness.", "cot": "[\"A grid of people coughing is shown with a voiceover explaining that coughing into your sleeve avoids sickness.\", \"Nine people cough into hands and sleeves while a voiceover instructs to use sleeves, accompanied by coughing sounds.\", \"People cough in video call frames, then demonstrate proper coughing into sleeves while text says \\\"No Hands Use Sleeve\\\" and audio says \\\"Simple way to avoid getting sick, try coughing into your sleeve instead of your hand.\\\"\", \"\\\\boxed{People cough in a grid while a narrator advises coughing into a sleeve to avoid sickness.}\", \"A group of people cough in a grid while a voice instructs to cough into a sleeve to avoid illness, followed by individuals exiting a building while covering their coughs with their sleeves.\"]", "time_sec": 20.814, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "439", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a zoo, a man is narrating a tiger with its teeth bared, and a roar comes from beside it.", "pred": "\\boxed{Tiger roaring, van parked, lions and tigers in cages, man speaking, and animal sounds}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Tiger roaring, van parked, lions and tigers in cages, man speaking, and animal sounds}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Tiger roaring, van parked, lions and tigers in cages, man speaking, and animal sounds}\", \"A tiger roars while a van with \\\"Single Vision\\\" branding sits near enclosures where a lion and white tiger rest behind fences.\", \"A tiger roars loudly while a man speaks about Single Vision's establishment in Florida, with a van and caged lion visible in the background.\", \"\\\\boxed{\\\\text{A tiger roars aggressively while a male voice describes Single Vision's establishment nine years ago at a Florida home.}}\", \"\\\\boxed{Tiger roars while van labeled Single Vision and \\\"Protecting the Vanishing Wild\\\" sits in yard, followed by a lion resting behind a wire fence and a white tiger vocalizing through chain-link fencing.}\"]", "time_sec": 22.381, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
