{"id": "441", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "After a film, four men sit behind a desk and do self-presentations, and the sound and music go to one night, a woman and two men talking.", "pred": "\\boxed{Purple \"Part 1\" text on black background, four men at table speaking and gesturing with music and voices, then dark scene with smiling woman and man, \"They kidnapped us!\" spoken over dramatic music}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Purple \"Part 1\" text on black background, four men at table speaking and gesturing with music and voices, then dark scene with smiling woman and man, \"They kidnapped us!\" spoken over dramatic music}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Purple \\\"Part 1\\\" text on black background, four men at table speaking and gesturing with music and voices, then dark scene with smiling woman and man, \\\"They kidnapped us!\\\" spoken over dramatic music}\", \"\\\\boxed{Four men sit at a table with papers while purple text \\\"Part 1\\\" appears; they speak introducing themselves as JLS, then a woman says \\\"They kidnapped us\\\" in a dark scene.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Purple \\\"Part 1\\\" text, four men at table, audio introduces JB Marvin Sarisha Aston JLS, then kidnapping dialogue}\", \"\\\\boxed{Purple 'Part 1' title card, four men seated at a table introducing themselves with background music and a 'They kidnapped us' audio clip.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Four men sit at a table speaking into microphones with background music and a sudden scream}\"]", "time_sec": 22.574, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.6, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "442", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a beard played his guitar skillfully with his fingers in the room and played beautiful music.", "pred": "\\boxed{Man plays classical guitar with audio of guitar notes while text lists Picado exercises and Free Stroke Fundamentals}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Man plays classical guitar with audio of guitar notes while text lists Picado exercises and Free Stroke Fundamentals}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Man plays classical guitar with audio of guitar notes while text lists Picado exercises and Free Stroke Fundamentals}\", \"\\\\boxed{Man plays classical guitar while fingerpicking notes are heard in black and white video with text overlays. }\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays acoustic guitar in black and white video with text listing \\\"10 Picado Agility Exercises\\\" and \\\"Picado Speed Drill\\\" while audio features fast, clear picado guitar playing.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays an acoustic guitar in black and white while fingerstyle music plays and text lists \\\"Picado Speed Drill - Sextuplets\\\" and \\\"Free Stroke Fundamentals\\\" on screen.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a classical guitar in black and white while fingerpicking notes and a list of \\\"Picado Agility Exercises\\\" and \\\"Free Stroke Fundamentals\\\" appears on screen.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.0, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "443", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "One hand left the clock with the pines pattern, tinkling and musical.", "pred": "\\boxed{A wooden cuckoo clock with carved trees and animals plays a melody while a hand adjusts its hands, showing Roman numerals on a black face against a white wall.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A wooden cuckoo clock with carved trees and animals plays a melody while a hand adjusts its hands, showing Roman numerals on a black face against a white wall.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A wooden cuckoo clock with carved trees and animals plays a melody while a hand adjusts its hands, showing Roman numerals on a black face against a white wall.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand adjusts a wooden cuckoo clock with carved squirrels and trees, chiming a melody with metallic bell sounds and a mechanical ticking.}\", \"A cuckoo clock with carved squirrels and pine trees displays Roman numerals while playing a melody and a hand adjusts its hands.\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand adjusts a cuckoo clock with Roman numerals while wood-carved squirrels and pine trees move and a clock chimes.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand adjusts a wooden cuckoo clock with squirrel figurines while mechanical music plays and a bell chimes.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.982, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "444", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red-and-white helicopter slowly flew along an empty roadside, as it spoke and buzzed and beside greeny.", "pred": "\\boxed{Red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter N303FD hovers low over green grass near runway with German commentary on its stability and performance}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter N303FD hovers low over green grass near runway with German commentary on its stability and performance}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter N303FD hovers low over green grass near runway with German commentary on its stability and performance}\", \"\\\\boxed{A red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter marked with number 3 and registration N303FD hovers over a runway while German-speaking male commentary praises its appearance and performance amid wind noise and rotor sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter N303FD hovers low over green grass near runway with German speech about landing gear and engine noise}\", \"\\\\boxed{A red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter (N303FD) hovers low over a runway with spinning rotors and a German-speaking male voice praising its build quality.\", \"\\\\boxed{Red and white Los Angeles Fire Department helicopter N303FD hovers above runway with German commentator praising its flight characteristics amid loud helicopter rotor noise.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.335, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash