{"id": "522", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two characters fight in the air, and the voice of the game, and the back ground music come out.", "pred": "A character battles a large purple creature with tentacles in a dark space environment while a voice shouts \"Don't let it escape!\" and \"Hurry!\" amidst explosions and impact sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A character battles a large purple creature with tentacles in a dark space environment while a voice shouts \"Don't let it escape!\" and \"Hurry!\" amidst explosions and impact sounds.", "cot": "[\"A character battles a large purple creature with tentacles in a dark space environment while a voice shouts \\\"Don't let it escape!\\\" and \\\"Hurry!\\\" amidst explosions and impact sounds.\", \"A blonde female character fights a dark monster with a blue sword in a space setting while a male voice shouts \\\"I won't forgive you!\\\" in Japanese amid intense electronic music and impact sounds.\", \"A character fights a large creature with glowing energy attacks in a space-themed game environment while Japanese text and sound effects play.\", \"A blonde anime character fights a purple squid-like creature in a space-themed video game with glowing projectiles, health bars, and Japanese text overlays while a voice shouts \\\"You can't get me!\\\" during combat.\", \"A female character attacks a large monster in a video game while music and voiceovers play.\"]", "time_sec": 22.226, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "523", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands outside, playing to the music and the voice of the woman, and a picture of the man is shown.", "pred": "A man stands by solar panels on a roof while a woman speaks about using a GoSun stove to break the cycle of poverty and reduce resource pressures.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A man stands by solar panels on a roof while a woman speaks about using a GoSun stove to break the cycle of poverty and reduce resource pressures.", "cot": "[\"A man stands by solar panels on a roof while a woman speaks about using a GoSun stove to break the cycle of poverty and reduce resource pressures.\", \"A man in a blue shirt stands before solar panels while a woman speaks about using a Go Sun Stove to break poverty cycles and reduce resource pressures, followed by a man adjusting a solar device outdoors.\", \"A man stands near solar panels while a woman speaks about poverty and resources, then a man crouches by a GoSun stove as the audio ends with a beep.\", \"A man looks at solar panels while a voice discusses using a Go Sun stove to break poverty cycles, followed by a man adjusting a solar cooker outdoors with a beeping sound.\", \"Black-and-white man with axe and text \\\"This Has To Stop\\\" with female speech about solar energy, man on roof with solar panels, man kneeling by device outdoors, black screen, black-and-white workshop with text \\\"The Plan\\\".\"]", "time_sec": 24.04, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
