{"id": "531", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A video with a black background shows two English sentences as the music plays.", "pred": "\\boxed{Black screen displays white text; audio features sustained high-pitched metallic chime and low drone. }", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Black screen displays white text; audio features sustained high-pitched metallic chime and low drone. }", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Black screen displays white text; audio features sustained high-pitched metallic chime and low drone. }\", \"\\\\boxed{Black screen with white text stating \\\"A reverb that loves creating organic ambient sonic textures\\\" and \\\"We thought so.\\\" accompanied by synthesized ambient music.}\", \"A reverb creating organic ambient sonic textures on a black screen with the text \\\"We thought so.\\\" while a dramatic musical piece plays.\", \"\\\\boxed{White text on black background states \\\"A reverb that loves creating organic ambient sonic textures\\\" and \\\"We thought so\\\" while bell-like chimes and sustained atmospheric synth pads play.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A black screen displays white text while a sustained high-pitched electronic tone fades in and out.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.121, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "532", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The movie theater was full of laughter and discussion, with one man taking off his hat and smiling and saying something, and then another man saying something.", "pred": "\\boxed{Young man in gray hoodie laughs in dark theater with audience chatter and indistinct speech}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Young man in gray hoodie laughs in dark theater with audience chatter and indistinct speech}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Young man in gray hoodie laughs in dark theater with audience chatter and indistinct speech}\", \"\\\\boxed{Young man in grey hoodie and green cap laughs in a dark theater while background crowd chatter and speech occur.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A young man in a green hat and grey hoodie smiles and gestures in a dark movie theater while indistinct crowd chatter and laughter play in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Man in green cap and grey hoodie smiles and laughs in dark theater while audience chatter and a woman's voice are heard.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Crowd laughs and cheers while a man in a green cap and sunglasses speaks in a dark auditorium, followed by a close-up of a man's face and a white screen. A speaker says \\\"This kid's on like an overload.\\\"}\"]", "time_sec": 22.213, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "533", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A sound of music sounded, the yellow text was sliding up and down, the grassland and snow and animals other background images are constantly changing.", "pred": "\\boxed{Text about Abraham over green field with music, then red rocks with water, then snow with person, audio is a mournful cello melody.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Text about Abraham over green field with music, then red rocks with water, then snow with person, audio is a mournful cello melody.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Text about Abraham over green field with music, then red rocks with water, then snow with person, audio is a mournful cello melody.}\", \"\\\\boxed{An aerial view of a person on a snowy path with yellow text about Abraham and a violin melody}\", \"Aerial views of grassy fields, rocky canyons, and snowy landscapes with yellow text about Abraham and Esther are displayed while a violin plays a slow, melancholic melody.\", \"\\\\boxed{Yellow text states teachings from a non-physical source named Abraham over a grassy field with a dog and a violin melody.\", \"Yellow text overlays describe Abraham as a non-physical source translating for Esther over changing landscapes including grassy fields, rocky canyons, and snowy forests while a solo violin plays a melancholic melody.\"]", "time_sec": 22.132, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "534", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A silver car was parked in the wild, and the man went over and pulled the door handle with his hand, and the door opened automatically.", "pred": "A hand opens a car door as a person speaks, producing a metallic click and thud. \\boxed{Hand opens car door with metallic click and thud as person speaks}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A hand opens a car door as a person speaks, producing a metallic click and thud. \\boxed{Hand opens car door with metallic click and thud as person speaks}", "cot": "[\"A hand opens a car door as a person speaks, producing a metallic click and thud. \\\\boxed{Hand opens car door with metallic click and thud as person speaks}\", \"\\\\boxed{Close-up of grey car door opening with latch click and scraping sounds as a man speaks calmly.}\", \"A hand opens a car door while a man speaks and metal clicks are heard.\", \"A person opens a car door with a metallic latch and creaking hinges, then speaks.\", \"\\\\boxed{A person opens a grey car door while speaking, accompanied by door creaking and thudding sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 18.427, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "535", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the music, a man and a woodpecker prepare to fight, followed by a fire that turns a tree into a stump and fires.", "pred": "A woodpecker clings to a tree in a forest as a man approaches and ignites the tree, causing an explosion while the text \"MALI DANGER\" and \"DYATEL DANGER\" appears on screen.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A woodpecker clings to a tree in a forest as a man approaches and ignites the tree, causing an explosion while the text \"MALI DANGER\" and \"DYATEL DANGER\" appears on screen.", "cot": "[\"A woodpecker clings to a tree in a forest as a man approaches and ignites the tree, causing an explosion while the text \\\"MALI DANGER\\\" and \\\"DYATEL DANGER\\\" appears on screen.\", \"A woodpecker is on a tree in a forest while a man with a gun fires, causing explosions, as the text \\\"FINISH HIM!\\\" appears and gunfire continues.\", \"A woodpecker on a tree in a forest with danger labels, a man holding a weapon and \\\"FINISH HIM!\\\" text appears, followed by a fireball explosion and a man chopping a burning tree stump while a man stands nearby with a rope.\", \"A woodpecker clings to a tree in a forest as a man throws a lit object that explodes on impact with the tree, accompanied by gunshots, a scream, and a fire explosion.\", \"\\\\boxed{Visual: A woodpecker clings to a tree while a man strikes a tree stump causing fire; Audio: gunfire followed by an explosion}\"]", "time_sec": 27.237, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "536", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Three men stood in front of the projector playing an instrument.", "pred": "\\boxed{Three people perform on a stage in a room with a whiteboard, one playing a didgeridoo producing a continuous low drone and two vocalizing, with musical instruments visible in the background.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Three people perform on a stage in a room with a whiteboard, one playing a didgeridoo producing a continuous low drone and two vocalizing, with musical instruments visible in the background.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Three people perform on a stage in a room with a whiteboard, one playing a didgeridoo producing a continuous low drone and two vocalizing, with musical instruments visible in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three performers stand on a stage with a whiteboard; the central figure plays a didgeridoo producing a deep drone while the left figure sings and the right figure plays guitar.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three performers stand on a stage with blue walls and a whiteboard, one plays a didgeridoo, another holds a microphone while the third sings, producing a continuous low-pitched drone sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three men stand on stage in a room with orange walls and a whiteboard; the man in the center plays a long didgeridoo while the man on the left sings into a microphone and the man on the right holds a guitar, accompanied by a low drone and a high-pitched female vocalization}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three performers on stage play a didgeridoo, a horn, and a guitar in a lecture hall with a whiteboard, while a low drone and high-pitched vocalizations are heard.}\"]", "time_sec": 26.953, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "i