{"id": "568", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the music went on, a man covered his face with his hand, and the picture turned, a woman with a pair of ponytails tilted her head against the tree.", "pred": "A hand with drawn facial features covers a face against a black background while a male vocalist sings, \"The lonely child, the lonely streets of...\" over rock music.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A hand with drawn facial features covers a face against a black background while a male vocalist sings, \"The lonely child, the lonely streets of...\" over rock music.", "cot": "[\"A hand with drawn facial features covers a face against a black background while a male vocalist sings, \\\"The lonely child, the lonely streets of...\\\" over rock music.\", \"\\\\boxed{Hand with drawn face covers eyes while Matt Norton Music plays on Facebook, then a woman in a white dress stands by a tree as a man sings}\", \"\\\\boxed{A woman with a face drawn on her hand covers her face while a female vocalist sings \\\"Inside\\\" and \\\"In the streets of...\\\" over a rock song, followed by a transition to a woman with braids leaning against a wall in a blue-lit scene.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand with a drawn face covers eyes while a woman in a white shawl leans against a wall with braids as a male sings \\\"love\\\" and \\\"child\\\" over music}\", \"\\\\boxed{Hand with face drawing covers eyes, woman in period dress leans on post, soft music plays, text overlays read \\\"Like Matt Norton Music on Facebook\\\" and \\\"Subscribe to our Youtube Chanel\\\"}\"]", "time_sec": 25.199, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "569", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a rainy night in the street, a man in a red and black coat drove a black car, knocked down a man in red, then got out to check and the two talked. During the rain.", "pred": "\\boxed{Rainy night street scene with car crash, two men in red jackets shouting French dialogue expressing shock and welcoming a boss.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Rainy night street scene with car crash, two men in red jackets shouting French dialogue expressing shock and welcoming a boss.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Rainy night street scene with car crash, two men in red jackets shouting French dialogue expressing shock and welcoming a boss.}\", \"A man in a red hoodie lands on a car at night in the rain, shouting \\\"Oh my god!\\\" while the driver asks \\\"You're not dead?\\\" and the man replies \\\"Welcome, boss\\\" as French speech occurs.\", \"A man in a red hooded jacket runs to a black car with headlights on in the rain at night, shouting \\\"My God! You're not dead?\\\" then \\\"Welcome, boss.\\\" as French voices yell \\\"Oh putain! C'est un drame!\\\" and \\\"Ah, le pauvre monsieur!\\\" with heavy engine rumble and metal clanging.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a red hoodie crashes a car, shouts \\\"Welcome, boss,\\\" while another man in a red jacket asks \\\"My God! You're not dead?\\\" amid chaotic impacts and French exclamations.}\", \"A man in a red hoodie crashes into a car, shouting in French as the driver asks \\\"My God! You're not dead?\\\", while rain falls on the wet street at night.\"]", "time_sec": 26.627, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
