 a blue-haired woman speaks, accompanied by crowd gasps, an exclamation, and a laugh.\"]", "time_sec": 63.087, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.56, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "582", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On the table there was a plate of chicken legs, a plate of green dishes and a plate of white dishes, and with the sound of chewing the food, a pair of orange chopsticks held up a shrimps, and the chopsticks turned the dishes through the plate.", "pred": "\\boxed{Chopsticks lift shrimp and egg from a white bowl while chewing and swallowing sounds occur alongside a glistening chicken leg on a white plate and green vegetables on a green checkered plate.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Chopsticks lift shrimp and egg from a white bowl while chewing and swallowing sounds occur alongside a glistening chicken leg on a white plate and green vegetables on a green checkered plate.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Chopsticks lift shrimp and egg from a white bowl while chewing and swallowing sounds occur alongside a glistening chicken leg on a white plate and green vegetables on a green checkered plate.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person eats a meal of chicken, meatballs, shrimp, and greens with pink chopsticks while chewing and smacking sounds are heard.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Chopsticks stir shrimp and egg in a bowl while chewing and swallowing occur, accompanied by a faint electronic hum.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Chopsticks stir shrimp and egg in a white bowl while chewing sounds play over fried chicken and greens on a checkered plate.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Chopsticks lift shrimp from a white bowl while a person eats chicken and greens, accompanied by chewing and utensil sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 23.026, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "583", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, a man was in the room with one hand in his mouth and one hand dragging the instrument in front of it.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo indoors, producing a deep, resonant drone with intermittent high-pitched squeaks and a final sharp bark.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo indoors, producing a deep, resonant drone with intermittent high-pitched squeaks and a final sharp bark.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo indoors, producing a deep, resonant drone with intermittent high-pitched squeaks and a final sharp bark.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo, producing a low, continuous, buzzing drone with a sudden high-pitched squeak, in a room with exercise equipment and wall art.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo indoors producing a low, continuous drone with rhythmic guttural vocalizations.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Man blows didgeridoo producing low drone with sudden high-pitched squeal}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a didgeridoo producing a low drone and high yelps in an indoor room}\"]", "time_sec": 19.765, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "584", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The yellow bird in the outdoor cage makes a sound, alongside the woman's voice.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two yellow cockatiels perch inside a wire cage while a woman speaks \"You're pretty Fred\" and a bird chirps.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two yellow cockatiels perch inside a wire cage while a woman speaks \"You're pretty Fred\" and a bird chirps.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two yellow cockatiels perch inside a wire cage while a woman speaks \\\"You're pretty Fred\\\" and a bird chirps.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two cockatiels in a cage chirp while a woman says \\\"You're pretty Fred\\\" and \\\"Pretty bird.\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Cockatiels in a cage with a yellow feeder and a person speaking while birds chirp.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Cockatiels in a cage chirp and squeak while a woman says \\\"You're pretty Fred\\\" and \\\"Pretty bird\\\"}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two yellow cockatiels in a cage with metal wire and wooden perches, hearing a female voice saying \\\"You're pretty Fred\\\" and \\\"Pretty bird\\\" amid bird chirps.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.124, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "585", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the woman spoke, a hand reached into the nest of a beak, which purred.", "pred": "\\boxed{A toucan in a hollow tree interacts with a human hand while a woman speaks and clicks her tongue}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A toucan in a hollow tree interacts with a human hand while a woman speaks and clicks her tongue}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A toucan in a hollow tree interacts with a human hand while a woman speaks and clicks her tongue}\", \"\\\\boxed{Toucan in nest with orange beak, human hand reaching in, speech, crinkling, and electronic buzz}\", \"A toucan with a large orange beak peeks out of a wooden hole while a human hand reaches in to touch its beak and the person speaks and clicks fingers.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{A toucan with a large orange beak peeks out of a wooden hole while a human hand reaches in to touch its beak and the person speaks and clicks fingers.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A toucan with a large orange and black beak is inside a wooden hole while a human hand reaches toward it and a female voice says 'anything' followed by 'Got the moon' and a child says 'Huh?' with mechanical clicking and a low hum.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Toucan in wooden nest, human hand touches beak, woman speaks \\\"something\\\" and \\\"in the moon\\\" with clicking and rustling sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 25.579, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
