{"id": "587", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A house is burning with white smoke, and there is a noise and a man's voice.", "pred": "\\boxed{Orange fire and black smoke erupt from a building at night while a male voice speaks over engine noise and water spray.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Orange fire and black smoke erupt from a building at night while a male voice speaks over engine noise and water spray.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Orange fire and black smoke erupt from a building at night while a male voice speaks over engine noise and water spray.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a nighttime building fire with orange flames and smoke; audio features a man speaking over a truck engine rumble.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Thick orange smoke and flames billow from a building window at night while water sprays and firefighters speak over radio static.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A building engulfed in nighttime flames with thick smoke billowing while firefighters spray water, accompanied by a man's voice discussing water pressure and a bucket.}}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals show a nighttime building fire with orange flames and smoke; audio features a helicopter and male voices communicating over radio.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.076, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.09, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "588", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Several brown sheep rested with the birds and the bleating of the sheep.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy enclosure with palm trees while a brown goat walks toward the camera, accompanied by bleating and footsteps}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy enclosure with palm trees while a brown goat walks toward the camera, accompanied by bleating and footsteps}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy enclosure with palm trees while a brown goat walks toward the camera, accompanied by bleating and footsteps}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two black goats stand on sand near a wall while a goat bleats and another animal walks away.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy enclosure with a palm tree and wall, while bleating occurs and a brown goat lies down, with a horse's legs visible in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy enclosure while bleating and a horse's hooves clip-clop on the sand.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two black goats stand in a sandy pen while bleating, followed by a close-up of a brown goat and bleating sounds.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.929, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "589", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the music, multiple images are switched continuously.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two people sing karaoke while a television displays lyrics.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two people sing karaoke while a television displays lyrics.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two people sing karaoke while a television displays lyrics.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man sings along with a woman to soulful music while lyrics appear on a TV screen in a dimly lit room.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two people singing karaoke with a man singing while a woman sings and lyrics appear on a Sony TV screen.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two women sing karaoke while a man watches as a song plays and a woman cries.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two people sing karaoke with lyrics \\\"She's a brick house\\\" and \\\"What do I do with these feelings\\\" over music.}\"]", "time_sec": 18.811, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "590", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the open field, a black, white-smoking aircraft slowly moved along the runway, with the blender roaring sound .", "pred": "\\boxed{A military jet accelerates on a runway in a barren landscape while a high-pitched engine whine dominates the audio.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A military jet accelerates on a runway in a barren landscape while a high-pitched engine whine dominates the audio.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A military jet accelerates on a runway in a barren landscape while a high-pitched engine whine dominates the audio.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A fighter jet accelerates down a runway in a barren landscape while a loud engine roar and high-pitched whine fill the audio.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A fighter jet accelerates on a runway in a desert while a loud engine roar is heard.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Fighter jet on runway with high-pitched engine roar}\", \"\\\\boxed{A military jet accelerates on a runway in a barren field while a high-pitched jet engine roars loudly.}\"]", "time_sec": 18.317, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "591", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red plush toy and a blue plush toy are placed on the bed, and a red toy is thrown at the green plush toy in one hand, with a voice in the picture.", "pred": "\\boxed{Red and blue plush toys face on bed as child says \"then I'll show you what I can do\" followed by \"okay\" and a slap sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Red and blue plush toys face on bed as child says \"then I'll show you what I can do\" followed by \"okay\" and a slap sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Red and blue plush toys face on bed as child says \\\"then I'll show you what I can do\\\" followed by \\\"okay\\\" and a slap sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Angry Bird plush confronts blue plush on bed; child speaks; slapping and thudding occur; green pig plush rolls on carpet.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two Angry Birds plushies interact on a bed while a child's voice says \\\"then I'll show you what I can do\\\" followed by \\\"okay\\\" and a thud.}}\", \"\\\\boxed{An orange plush bird and blue plush bird face each other on a bed with a green plush pig on the carpet, while a female voice says \\\"then I'll show you what I can do,\\\" followed by a child's \\\"okay,\\\" an \\\"ugh,\\\" a snap, and a thud.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Angry Bird plush confronts blue bird on bed while child's voice says \\\"I'll show you what I can do\\\" followed by \\\"Okay\\\" and \\\"Ah\\\" with fabric rustling and a thud on carpet}\"]", "time_sec": 26.898, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
