{"id": "594", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in green and black headphones, holding the machine in his hand, made a rumbling sound as a crowd stood watching.", "pred": "\\boxed{A large green military engine idles loudly on a stand while a man in camouflage operates it and onlookers observe in an industrial setting.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A large green military engine idles loudly on a stand while a man in camouflage operates it and onlookers observe in an industrial setting.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A large green military engine idles loudly on a stand while a man in camouflage operates it and onlookers observe in an industrial setting.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Large green military engine idles on a stand with a man in camouflage operating it while a crowd observes and a loud engine sound plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A large green military engine idles loudly on a trailer while a man in camouflage observes from the top and bystanders watch nearby.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A massive green industrial engine with two cooling fans on a metal stand emits loud mechanical rumbling while surrounded by spectators in a workshop}\", \"\\\\boxed{A large green industrial engine idles loudly while spectators watch in an open garage, a man in camouflage operates it atop the machinery.}}\"]", "time_sec": 21.15, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "595", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the outdoor parking lot, there are cars, one of which is a white BMW, the exhaust pipes are white smoke and buzzing, and men are talking.", "pred": "\\boxed{White, black, and silver BMWs in a lot while a man says \"let's do a little rev time\" and revs a car engine.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{White, black, and silver BMWs in a lot while a man says \"let's do a little rev time\" and revs a car engine.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{White, black, and silver BMWs in a lot while a man says \\\"let's do a little rev time\\\" and revs a car engine.}\", \"\\\\boxed{In a parking lot with white and black BMWs, a person revs a car engine, producing loud exhaust noises and engine roars.}\", \"\\\\boxed{White BMW M4 in parking lot with engine revving and exhaust sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{White BMWs in a lot with a man revving a car engine.}}\", \"A person revs a white BMW M4 engine with dual exhausts in a parking lot filled with other BMWs.\"]", "time_sec": 20.119, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
