{"id": "608", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Three fowls were cackling at food in the wild, and people were talking.", "pred": "\\boxed{Three chickens peck at feed on dirt floor in wire enclosure with green foliage background while a rooster crows and a man speaks in Bengali.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Three chickens peck at feed on dirt floor in wire enclosure with green foliage background while a rooster crows and a man speaks in Bengali.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Three chickens peck at feed on dirt floor in wire enclosure with green foliage background while a rooster crows and a man speaks in Bengali.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three chickens peck dirt in a wire-mesh coop while a rooster crows and a man speaks in Bengali.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Roosters walk in a coop with a white container while a man speaks in Bengali and a rooster crows.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three chickens peck dirt while a rooster stands alert in a wire enclosure with a white carrier and hose, accompanied by a man speaking in Bengali and intermittent rooster crowing.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Three chickens peck feed while a rooster stands; a man speaks in Bengali and a rooster crows.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.448, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "609", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the narration went on, a big dog was growling at a puppy lying on the floor.", "pred": "\\boxed{Huskies play with a puppy and a toy while a woman speaks and a dog barks.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Huskies play with a puppy and a toy while a woman speaks and a dog barks.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Huskies play with a puppy and a toy while a woman speaks and a dog barks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A gray and white husky plays with a white puppy on a wooden floor while a gray and white husky barks and a woman speaks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two huskies play with a puppy while a woman speaks, dogs bark, and a fan hums in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Huskies play with a puppy while a woman speaks and a dog barks in a living room with scattered toys.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two huskies play with a white puppy on a wooden floor; a woman speaks and dogs bark.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.082, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "610", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a small child at the computer desk clicked his keyboard and mouse in a random manner, making a clicking sound, and a grown-up voice said something.", "pred": "\\boxed{A young child in a floral shirt sits at a desk with a black keyboard and mouse, pressing keys while making clicking sounds and uttering \"Eh\" and \"Eh-ah-ah\" amid soft thuds.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A young child in a floral shirt sits at a desk with a black keyboard and mouse, pressing keys while making clicking sounds and uttering \"Eh\" and \"Eh-ah-ah\" amid soft thuds.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A young child in a floral shirt sits at a desk with a black keyboard and mouse, pressing keys while making clicking sounds and uttering \\\"Eh\\\" and \\\"Eh-ah-ah\\\" amid soft thuds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Young girl with short black hair in floral shirt uses computer mouse and keyboard while crinkling snack bag and making babbling sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A child in a floral shirt uses a black keyboard and mouse at a wooden desk with a box nearby, producing mouse clicks, rustling, and speech.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A toddler in a floral shirt uses a Dell keyboard and mouse at a wooden desk while a box sits on a black surface, accompanied by typing clicks, a groan, and a woman's \\\"Yeah\\\" and \\\"I'm not\\\" speech.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A child uses a computer mouse and keyboard while a cat meows and a man speaks.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.397, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
