{"id": "631", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Inside, a man was speaking, pressing the cash register on the table, which was dripping.", "pred": "\\boxed{Sharp XE-A102 cash register on counter with green display showing 0.00, hand pressing keys, speaker describing PDF file and functionality, and register beep sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Sharp XE-A102 cash register on counter with green display showing 0.00, hand pressing keys, speaker describing PDF file and functionality, and register beep sound.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Sharp XE-A102 cash register on counter with green display showing 0.00, hand pressing keys, speaker describing PDF file and functionality, and register beep sound.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand operates a Sharp XE-A102 cash register on a beige countertop, displaying 0.00 to 12.00, while a male voice states \\\"PDF file on it that we will send to you along with the register, and as you can see, it does work, and we'll add a couple.\\\"}\", \"A hand presses keys on a Sharp XE-A102 cash register displaying 0.00 while a man states it works and a PDF will be sent.\", \"\\\\boxed{A person operates a Sharp XE-A102 cash register on a beige counter while a male voice explains sending a PDF file and confirming the register works. }\", \"\\\\boxed{Sharp XE-A102 cash register on counter displays 0.00; hand presses keys showing 7820 and 1200 while speaker states PDF file on it will be sent with the register as it does work}\"]", "time_sec": 28.273, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "632", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man in a pink plaid top spoke with a phone, then sped to another man, and the grey colour man will be answer the phone.", "pred": "Two men converse outdoors while one speaks on a mobile phone; a sudden electronic beep interrupts the audio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "Two men converse outdoors while one speaks on a mobile phone; a sudden electronic beep interrupts the audio.", "cot": "[\"Two men converse outdoors while one speaks on a mobile phone; a sudden electronic beep interrupts the audio.\", \"\\\\boxed{\\\\text{Two men in outdoor settings with lush greenery and buildings, one on a phone call while another approaches and speaks, accompanied by a loud electronic beep and intermittent male speech.}}\", \"Two men converse outdoors with lush greenery while one talks on a cell phone and the other gestures, accompanied by rhythmic music and intermittent speech.\", \"\\\\boxed{Two men converse outdoors; one speaks into a phone while the other listens, followed by a handshake and continued dialogue amid ambient street sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Two men converse outdoors with one on a phone call while another man approaches and shakes hands, accompanied by a phone ringtone and speech.}\"]", "time_sec": 21.746, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "633", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of the water, a child bathed in the bathtub, his hands were moving, the water from the faucet rushed toward the child's body, the child kissed the faucet, and there was a voice beside it.", "pred": "\\boxed{A hand holds a silver shower head spraying water over a child in a white tub with a continuous hiss and a woman's voice speaking in the background}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A hand holds a silver shower head spraying water over a child in a white tub with a continuous hiss and a woman's voice speaking in the background}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A hand holds a silver shower head spraying water over a child in a white tub with a continuous hiss and a woman's voice speaking in the background}\", \"\\\\boxed{A baby is being bathed with a handheld showerhead while water runs and a woman speaks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A child bathes with a handheld showerhead while water runs and a woman speaks.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hand holds a chrome shower head spraying water on a child in a bubble bath while water flows and a woman speaks in the background}\", \"\\\\boxed{A child in a bubble bath plays with a shower head while an adult speaks and water sprays, creating a hissing sound.}\"]", "time_sec": 19.594, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "634", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man at the sewing machine clatters while talking.", "pred": "\\boxed{A person operates a sewing machine on white fabric with blue trim while a sewing machine hums and a man speaks in Italian.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A person operates a sewing machine on white fabric with blue trim while a sewing machine hums and a man speaks in Italian.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A person operates a sewing machine on white fabric with blue trim while a sewing machine hums and a man speaks in Italian.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A person operates a white sewing machine stitching blue-edged white fabric while a sewing machine motor hums and a man speaks Italian}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white sewing machine stitches blue trim onto white fabric while a sewing machine hums and a male voice speaks in Italian}\", \"\\\\boxed{A white sewing machine stitches blue-edged white fabric while a sewing machine motor hums and a man speaks Italian.}\", \"A sewing machine stitches blue tape onto white fabric while a man speaks and the machine hums loudly.\"]", "time_sec": 19.183, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
