{"id": "636", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "With the sound of his voice, a mouse jumped into the plants.", "pred": "\\boxed{A hamster emerges from blue material as tools lie nearby, then moves through green foliage while birds chirp and people speak.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A hamster emerges from blue material as tools lie nearby, then moves through green foliage while birds chirp and people speak.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A hamster emerges from blue material as tools lie nearby, then moves through green foliage while birds chirp and people speak.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hamster emerges from a blue object with pliers nearby as a voice states \\\"He's out,\\\" followed by a bird feeder discussion and bird chirping.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hamster exits a blue plastic structure near pliers as a person speaks, then it moves through green leaves while birds chirp and a bird feeder is mentioned.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A hamster escapes a blue plastic object while pliers lie nearby, followed by a person releasing it into green foliage with birds chirping and a woman exclaiming \\\"yay\\\" as a man discusses a closing bird feeder.}\", \"A hamster escapes from blue tape while pliers lie nearby, a person releases it into green foliage as voices discuss a bird feeder and sounds of birds and nature play.\"]", "time_sec": 23.193, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "637", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the room, a man stood in front of the television playing a violin, making a beautiful musical sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man plays violin indoors while watching a computer screen showing dancing women in red Santa outfits.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man plays violin indoors while watching a computer screen showing dancing women in red Santa outfits.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A man plays violin indoors while watching a computer screen showing dancing women in red Santa outfits.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in glasses plays violin while watching Santa dancers on an iMac screen in a dim room.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a violin in a dark room while a TV shows a dancing Santa group.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays violin in a dim room with a holly border while a computer screen shows dancing Santas and holiday music plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man plays a violin in a dim room with a holly decoration while a computer screen shows Santa-clad dancers performing \\\"Winter Wonderland\\\" in the background.}\"]", "time_sec": 20.528, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "638", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "There was a lion in the cage. A man reached into the cage and touched the lion. There was a sound of water running around.", "pred": "\\boxed{A man in a brown jacket and blue cap reaches through green bars of a cage to touch a lion's mane while a motorcycle engine idles and a man speaks briefly.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A man in a brown jacket and blue cap reaches through green bars of a cage to touch a lion's mane while a motorcycle engine idles and a man speaks briefly.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A man in a brown jacket and blue cap reaches through green bars of a cage to touch a lion's mane while a motorcycle engine idles and a man speaks briefly.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Lion in green metal cage, man in brown jacket and blue cap touching lion, loud water splashing, man saying \\\"Yeah\\\", lion growling.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a brown jacket and blue cap interacts with a lion in a green cage, petting its mane and head while the lion vocalizes, with water splashing and a man's voice audible.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a brown jacket and blue cap reaches into a green metal cage to pet a lion, with loud water splashing and a male voice saying \\\"That\\\" in the background.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Lion in cage, man petting lion, water splashing, engine running, man speaking}\"]", "time_sec": 23.613, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
