{"id": "640", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "To the music, two men in white vests sang and danced in front of a dazzling with background music.", "pred": "\\boxed{Two men in white tank tops dance and gesture against shifting colored backgrounds while Burmese lyrics and music play.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Two men in white tank tops dance and gesture against shifting colored backgrounds while Burmese lyrics and music play.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{Two men in white tank tops dance and gesture against shifting colored backgrounds while Burmese lyrics and music play.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals: Yellow explosion, man in white tank top dancing, second man in red cap joins; Audio: Burmese male singing with electronic dance music.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Visuals: yellow burst, man in white tank top singing/dancing with man in red cap against changing colorful backgrounds. Audio: upbeat Burmese pop song with male vocals and rhythmic beat.}\", \"A man in a white tank top sings and dances with another man in a red cap against a colorful animated background while upbeat electronic music plays and Burmese subtitles scroll at the bottom.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man in a white tank top sings and gestures against a colorful, swirling background with a second man in a red cap appearing behind him, while upbeat electronic music with male vocals plays and Burmese text appears at the bottom.}\"]", "time_sec": 23.577, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "641", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A little girl coughed ,and the person next to her brushed her face with a towel as she spoke.", "pred": "\\boxed{A child cries while being held with a hand on their neck, accompanied by baby sounds, a voice saying \"Did you?\", a \"Uh-huh\", and a child's voice saying \"I'm gonna get you\" in a room with a standing person wearing a bracelet.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A child cries while being held with a hand on their neck, accompanied by baby sounds, a voice saying \"Did you?\", a \"Uh-huh\", and a child's voice saying \"I'm gonna get you\" in a room with a standing person wearing a bracelet.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A child cries while being held with a hand on their neck, accompanied by baby sounds, a voice saying \\\"Did you?\\\", a \\\"Uh-huh\\\", and a child's voice saying \\\"I'm gonna get you\\\" in a room with a standing person wearing a bracelet.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A young child in a blue shirt cries while an adult's hand touches their neck, with baby bleating and clucking sounds audible.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A young child in a blue shirt cries with a hand on their neck while an adult's hand touches their shoulder, accompanied by goat bleating and clucking sounds.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Child cries while being held and fed by an adult in a room with another person present, accompanied by baby cries, squeals, and speech.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Child crying with adult hand on neck while goat bleats and woman speaks}\"]", "time_sec": 22.57, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "642", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On a green meadow, a man in a hat was herding a cow, a dog barked at the cow, some of which had bells around their necks and rang as they moved.", "pred": "\\boxed{A herder walks a dirt path in a green mountain pasture with white and brown cows and a black dog while a dog barks and electronic music plays.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A herder walks a dirt path in a green mountain pasture with white and brown cows and a black dog while a dog barks and electronic music plays.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A herder walks a dirt path in a green mountain pasture with white and brown cows and a black dog while a dog barks and electronic music plays.}\", \"\\\\boxed{Cows graze in a mountainous pasture while a herder walks among them, accompanied by a dog barking and folk music playing.}\", \"A man herds cows up a grassy hill with a dog, accompanied by dog barks and cowbells.\", \"A man walks with a dog in a green field with cows and a dog barks.\", \"\\\\boxed{A herder walks a herd of cows with a dog on a grassy hillside while a dog barks and folk music plays}\"]", "time_sec": 19.883, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": 7.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 4.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "643", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man spoke by a tree, then appeared on a bridge where vehicles whistled, then switched to a picture of people riding bicycles, a man washing a face with a water bottle  and finally a hand unlocking..", "pred": "A bearded man speaks at a skatepark with ramps and trees behind him while a train passes a graffiti-covered bridge and water splashes over a person's face as a bike wheel rolls on concrete.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "A bearded man speaks at a skatepark with ramps and trees behind him while a train passes a graffiti-covered bridge and water splashes over a person's face as a bike wheel rolls on concrete.", "cot": "[\"A bearded man speaks at a skatepark with ramps and trees behind him while a train passes a graffiti-covered bridge and water splashes over a person's face as a bike wheel rolls on concrete.\", \"\\\\boxed{A man speaks at a skate park while a train passes over a graffiti-covered bridge and a person splashes water.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man speaks at a skatepark while a train passes overhead and water splashes.}\", \"Man speaks near skate ramps, train passes graffiti bridge, BMX rides, water splashes, and sunset view with bridge and river.\\n\\n\\\\boxed{Man speaks near skate ramps, train passes graffiti bridge, BMX rides, water splashes, and sunset view with bridge and river.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A man speaks at a skatepark with ramps, followed by a sunset view of a bridge over water, a bicycle wheel, wildflowers, a graffiti-covered train bridge, and water splashing.}\"]", "time_sec": 24.246, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 4.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "644", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A band played instruments in the middle of the square, with the sounds of conversation among the people around it.", "pred": "\\boxed{A pipe and drum band in orange kilts plays bagpipes and drums in the rain under a stone archway.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A pipe and drum band in orange kilts plays bagpipes and drums in the rain under a stone archway.}", "cot": "[\"\\\\boxed{A pipe and drum band in orange kilts plays bagpipes and drums in the rain under a stone archway.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pipe band in orange kilts plays bagpipes and drums in the rain under stone arches.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A military-style pipe and drum band in orange kilts and green jackets performs in the rain before stone arches, producing high-pitched bagpipe music with audible drum beats and distant crowd murmurs.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pipe band in kilts plays bagpipes and drums in the rain under stone arches.}\", \"\\\\boxed{A pipe band in traditional attire performs in the rain under stone arches as bagpipes play a melody.}\"]", "time_sec": 19.759, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": true, "audio": true, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.7, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
